  {:id "2605192300" :title "etzhayyim Bootstrap Council 5名 — initial Lv6+ ロスター + 5軸 expertise + Phase 2 移行" :status "proposed" :status_note "Seat 1 (Founder=Jun Kawasaki) 固定 + Seat 2-5 (Substrate/Legal-Ethics/Economics/Stewardship) を 30日 public objection period で確定。3-of-5 multisig が Charter attestation / PublicFund grant / Land dispute / Force authorization / Steward succession / Eros-Gore boundary 判断の sign-off。Phase 2 (formal Council ADR) 移行 trigger: 構成員1000名 / Council 1名 死亡 / 構成員 3 名 request / 12ヶ月経過" :path "90-docs/adr/2605192300-etzhayyim-bootstrap-council-five.md" :operational_addendum "90-docs/2605212036-council-bootstrap-rfp-operational-addendum.md"}
