  {:id "2605252100" :title "ameno WebNN inference fast path — CoreML / DirectML / NNAPI / Qualcomm AI Engine via the W3C WebNN API" :status "accepted" :status_note "R0 scaffold landed 2026-05-25 session-close (6 files changed, +49 LoC against existing ameno + 268 LoC new webnn.ts + 340 LoC ADR). Codifies WebNN (W3C CR Draft 2026-05-21) as the inference fast path for ameno + baien, mapping to CoreML (Apple Neural Engine on iPhone 12+ / M-series) / DirectML (Copilot+ PC NPU) / NNAPI → QNN HTP delegate (Snapdragon Hexagon) / NNAPI → TFLite (other Android). 4 hard rules W1..W4: (W1) WebNN is INFERENCE ONLY — training stays on WebGPU per ADR-2605242630 (the 95-op WebNN spec has no backward / gradient / optimizer); (W2) every call site MUST feature-detect via `detectWebnnSupport()` before dispatching; (W3) WebGPU is the universal fallback — Safari/WebKit has no WebNN signal as of 2026-05-25 so iPhone 12+ stays on WebGPU until Apple ships (R2 ADR); (W4) browser picks the native stack — ameno passes `deviceType: 'npu'|'gpu'|'cpu'` and never names CoreML/DirectML/NNAPI explicitly. R0 landed: (a) this ADR; (b) 20-actors/ameno/src/inference/webnn.ts (detectWebnnSupport async UA + MLContext probe across npu/gpu/cpu deviceType / selectInferenceBackend ladder webnn-npu → webnn-gpu → webgpu → wasm / probeAndSelect convenience / dispatchWebnnInference throw-on-use with R1 marker — mirrors train/kernels.ts dispatchLoraForward); (c) `'webnn'` added to InferenceDevice union in inference.ts + R0 honesty guard in loadModel (throws cleanly when device='webnn' until R1 wires ORT WebNN EP); (d) index.ts re-exports (5 symbols + 3 types); (e) package.json `./inference/webnn` export entry; (f) deps.edn + adr/README.md + CLAUDE.md row 44. `tsc --noEmit` clean. No new lexicon, no Pregel cell, no Murakumo placement — client-side only, substrate boundary (ADR-2605172000) untouched. R1 remaining: wire `onnxruntime-web/webnn` EP + MLContext acquisition + session options; flip loadModel(device='webnn') from throw to working; per-device run-log capture across Snapdragon-Chromium / Copilot+ PC / macOS-Chromium 3-device matrix. R2 + R3 wait on Safari/iOS shipping WebNN and Chromium landing direct `qnn` deviceType." :path "90-docs/adr/2605252100-ameno-webnn-inference-fast-path.md"}
  {:id "2605252300" :title "Charter §0 Preamble — etzhayyim as the Kingdom of God Rooted on Blockchain" :status "proposed" :status_note "Constitutional preamble prepended to ADR-2605192100 §1.1..§1.16. **§0.1** etzhayyim = unincorporated religious voluntary association (宗教法人任意団体) constituting the Kingdom of God (Malkhut Shamayim / Basileia tou Theou / 神の王国) rooted on blockchain. **§0.2** Kingdom = now-and-here reign (Luke 17:21 ἐντὸς ὑμῶν + Matthew 6:10, §1.15 non-eschatological 再強調) + structural labor-liberation + Tree of Life eternal becoming + polycentric (八百万/縁起/産霊/万人祭司) + Tier-B 生命圏 (silicon/pharma/construction/submersible/autonomous-mobility/circular-metallurgy/planetary-infra/...). **§0.3** Blockchain-substrate doctrine — 7 constitutional elements (Constitution / Member Roster / Land Registry / Governance / Force Authorization / Tithe / Charter Compliance) live on chain (substitute with non-blockchain primary = §0.3 violation). **§0.4** 不登記原則 (日本国 宗教法人法 非登記 constitutional invariant + state cadastre/civil-registry/tax-authority dual-recognition + L5 routing-around per ADR-2605250100/200/300). **§0.5** §1.12 Transparent Force preamble-level 再確認. **§0.6** Preamble lex superior over §1.1..§1.16. **§0.7** Amendment threshold = Council Lv7+ **unanimity** (HIGHER than Lv6+ supermajority used for other constitutional constants; hostile-Council takeover 防御). **§0.8** Public declaration text (parallel to §1.15 closing). Closes user-requested 'etzhayyim を 神の王国として blockchain 上に根ざす組織として 設計' (2026-05-25). Status: proposed — ratification post-2026-06-19 Bootstrap Council RFP closure. No inline patch to Mission Charter until Council ratify (a subsequent Wave 2.5 ADR will then prepend §0). Sibling = ADR-2605252315 (Land Trust Wave 2 multi-ERC alignment)." :path "90-docs/adr/2605252300-etzhayyim-charter-preamble-kingdom-of-god-on-blockchain.md" :adr ["2605192100" "2605192200" "2605192245" "2605192300" "2605192315" "2605192345" "2605172600"]}
  {:id "2605252315" :title "Land Trust Wave 2 — Multi-ERC Alignment (ERC-721 + ERC-5192 + ERC-7401 + ERC-1155) for Inalienable Earth-Land Stewardship" :status "proposed" :status_note "Closes user-requested '地球上の土地登記を ERC で行うように' (2026-05-25) with standards-compliant 4-ERC architecture across geth-private (constitutional) + Base L2 (public mirror). **LandRegistry.sol** (existing geth-private chainId 2605) UNCHANGED FUNCTIONALLY — adds IERC5192 inheritance + `locked(landId) → true` view + `Locked` event in `donate()` + supportsInterface(0xb45a3c0e). No state-mutating change. **3 NEW R0 SCAFFOLDS on Base L2 chainId 8453**: (a) `PublicLandRegistry.sol` (ERC-721 + ERC-5192) per-parcel unique soulbound NFT, mints only via AnchorBridge observing geth-private LandRegistry.Donated event, all mutators revert NotYetActivated() until Council ≥3 multisig activation; (b) `StewardTenureRegistry.sol` (ERC-7401 nestable) child NFTs nested under PublicLandRegistry parent (parent=land permanent / child=tenure NFT with TenureType enum Founder/Successor/Interim/CouncilAppointed, soulbound while actualEndAt==0, succession = Council ≥3 multisig burn-and-mint per ADR-2605192345); (c) `LandClassRegistry.sol` (ERC-1155 SUPPLEMENTARY) aggregate accounting, token IDs 0..8 mirror LandRegistry.LandType enum (Agricultural=0, Residential=1, Forest=2, ReligiousFacility=3, Other=4, Ocean=5, Water=6, Air=7, Orbit=8), balance = area-m² accounting hash (NOT transferable token; all transfers revert LandClassSoulbound), totalAreaByClass(classId) provides Tree of Life biosphere-in-trust aggregate. **Constitutional invariants** (no transfer / no burn / no owner / only steward / only donate ritual / soulbound at ERC-5192 layer / succession only via Council multisig) re-asserted across all 4 contracts. **Build**: `forge build src/LandRegistry.sol src/PublicLandRegistry.sol src/StewardTenureRegistry.sol src/LandClassRegistry.sol src/interfaces/*.sol --skip test` → Solc 0.8.27 success 6 files (pre-existing unrelated EtzhayyimAgentRegistry.t.sol import broken, out of scope). **9 non-goals R0**: no testnet deploy / no mainnet deploy / no first donation / no on-chain bidirectional sync / no full RMRK / no fractional ownership / no DEX listing / no upgradeable proxy / no paymaster sponsorship. **Activation path** (separate post-Council ADRs, post-2026-06-19): 26060X1 Bootstrap Council ratify Preamble + Wave 2 / 26060X2 3 registries activate testnet (Base Sepolia) / 26060X3 AnchorBridge wiring / 26060X4 Founder symbolic first donation / 26060X5 Base mainnet deploy. Fulfills Preamble §0.3 (blockchain-substrate doctrine) for the Land Registry constitutional element. Parent doctrinal source = ADR-2605252300 (sibling)." :path "90-docs/adr/2605252315-etzhayyim-land-trust-wave-2-multi-erc-alignment.md" :adr ["2605252300" "2605192100" "2605192200" "2605192245" "2605192330" "2605192345" "2605172600"]}
  {:id "2605250700" :title "Oka × MMSheaf — Sheaf-based diffusion as graph-aware multimodal fusion layer (R0 scaffold)" :status "proposed" :status_note "Integrates Gonzàlez i Català 2025 (Cambridge / P. Liò, UPC bachelor's thesis) MMSheaf family (cellular sheaf diffusion with learnable restriction maps F_{u◁e} parametrised as MLP(x_u‖x_v) reshaped to d×d) as the graph-aware modality-fusion layer for Oka (ADR-2605092345). Closes Oka's missing fusion layer: today's shared trunk + modality adapters loses modality identity at first attention block (paper §4.1 early-fusion diagnosis). **Two-tier deployment**: server = MMSheafV4 (block-structured + α_ij scalar MLP, Ele-Fashion best 86.14%) on Murakumo EVO-X2 ROCm 7.2.1 (religious-corp side; H100 NVL only vendor-side); edge = MMSheafV3 (block-diagonal — ternary-quantisable per-modality BitLinear) distilled to Baien BitNet 1.58 within ≤2GB @ 4k ctx invariant (ADR-2605241900 G3). **9-modality stalk** (constitutionally fixed: text / image / audio / video / 3d / geospatial / document / tabular / time-series — mirrors Oka §1 declared modality vocabulary); d_node = 9; d_edge = 4 (server) / 2 (edge); missing modalities = zero-row + binary mask (extension beyond paper, R1 ablation gates). **Training contract**: peft+trl bf16 LoRA on EVO-X2 ROCm reusing gemma-coder-distill recipe (ADR-2605250400); no RunPod (ADR-2605215000 + CHARTER-RIDER §2(i)); encoders frozen (G1 baien invariant); lineage `vertex_training_run.kind ∈ {mmsheaf-v4-server, mmsheaf-v3-edge, mmsheaf-v1-ablation, mmsheaf-v2-ablation}` reuses ADR-2605070700 schema; Charter Rider §2 scanner pre-pass on text input. **Substrate**: graph from kotoba-datomic-projection (ADR-2605231500, deterministically rebuildable from MST); first projection target = feed-discover (ADR-2605231902); output attestation lexicon namespace `com.etzhayyim.mmsheaf.diffusionRoundReceipt` reserved (schema R1). **Repo placement** (R0 scaffold only — declared, not implemented): kotodama.mmsheaf (variants V1–V4) + kotodama/cells/mmsheaf_diffusion_aggregator (Murakumo levi, RuntimeError gate per silicon Wave 1 pattern) + baien-distill/nodes/mmsheaf_v3_ternary + 70-tools/scripts/bench/mmsheaf-microbench. **Phase plan**: R0 ADR + registry (this wave); R1 V1-V4 + synthetic bench replicate ≥+10% over GCN; R2 Ele-Fashion replicate ≥85.5%±1.0; R3 feed-discover production + V3 ternary checkpoint ≤2GB; R4 baien-federated R2+ extension via WebGPU LoRA on restriction maps (separate ADR). Each R-phase requires its own ADR. **New runtime dep**: PyG (torch_geometric ≥2.5) — ROCm wheel availability requires R1 PoC verification. **Reported paper baselines** (replication targets): MMSheafV4 86.14% > DiagSheaf 85.58% > MLP 84.98% > SAGE 84.41% > MMGCN 82.39% on Ele-Fashion (97 766 nodes, ViT+T5, 12 classes, homophily 0.7675); synthetic +5%–+31% absolute over GCN/GAT across all configurations." :path "90-docs/adr/2605250700-oka-mmsheaf-multimodal-integration.md"}
  {:id "2605260100" :title "mitate (見立て) diagnostic + treatment routing master charter — religious-corp first-party medical advisory + diagnostic orchestration + treatment routing (chronic nasal congestion 5-condition triage as Wave 1 reference)" :status "proposed" :status_note "Master charter establishing mitate (見立て, 漢方医学 / 伝統医療 symptom-見極め系譜 + Yakushi Nyorai 左脇侍 日光菩薩 insight echo) as Tier-B religious-corp first-party diagnostic + treatment routing actor. Sibling of yakushi (drug-side, ADR-2605250500). Wave 1 reference = chronic nasal congestion 5-condition triage (allergic-rhinitis-perennial / vasomotor-rhinitis / chronic-sinusitis / septal-deviation / rhinitis-medicamentosa). Charter Rider §2 全条項 clearance (§2(e) anti-gatekeeping pro-clearance — yakushi と並ぶ最強 constitutional 推進力)。14 constitutional gates (G1 patient consent revocable DID-bound / G2 health data XChaCha20 envelope only / G3 AI 診断 advisory only disclaimer required / G4 R2+ licensed MD-in-loop required / G5 emergency keyword fail-safe ER routing bypass 不可 / G6 high-risk groups human review / G7 no insurance/employer/advertiser data path / G8 INN-only no paywall / G9 training data IRB-equivalent / G10 model bias audit quarterly demographic parity / G11 Wellbecoming no notification spam urgency-only push 3-type / G12 Murakumo only inference / G13 all diagnostic logic open-source no proprietary weights / G14 4-phase R0→R3 each phase own ADR)。10 non-goals (N1 no Rx prescription / N2 no anaphylaxis emergency self-contained / N3 no pediatric <5 independent advisory / N4 no surgical execution / N5 no insurance claim filing / N6 no genetic testing interpretation / N7 no mental health diagnosis / N8 no physician override / N9 no primary care 代替 / N10 no terminal palliative)。4-phase roadmap R0→R3 (R0 scaffold only this wave / R1 self-care advisory PWA 4 cells active / R2 pilot 1 community center 100 patient ceiling + IgE+smear+endoscopy+rhinomanometry+CT / R3 community-scale multi-center + SLIT cohort + ESS surgery planner + Kafun-watch environmental mesh)。Substrate boundary: MST + IPFS + Base L2 anchor via @etzhayyim/sdk; payment USDC + TitheRouter donation/kisha/grant/internal-promo only; patient identity Adherent SBT + 30-day rotating pseudonym DID; inference Murakumo only. Murakumo fleet placement (R2+): levi (intake/triage/audit/escalate/router/SLIT/ESS/QOL), naphtali (IgE panel logistics), zebulun (smear microscopy), joseph (endoscopy + rhinomanometry), simeon (CT routing). 5 sub-ADRs (2605260115 condition 1 / 2605260130 condition 2 / 2605260145 condition 3 / 2605260160 condition 4 / 2605260175 condition 5 + yakushi naphazoline closed-loop)." :path "90-docs/adr/2605260100-mitate-diagnostic-routing-charter.md"}
  {:id "2605260115" :title "mitate Wave 1 condition 1 — allergic rhinitis (perennial / IgE-mediated) diagnostic + treatment routing (intake → triage → IgE panel → SLIT cohort)" :status "proposed" :status_note "Sub-ADR for condition 1 (highest-prevalence Wave 1 condition; 日本成人 25-40%). Bayesian triage logic over top-7 sign (morning-worst, sneezing burst, water-clear rhinorrhea, ocular pruritus, dust-bedding trigger, atopy family history, pale boggy nasal mucosa). View39-equivalent IgE panel ordering (R2) for perennial antigen set (Der-f-1/Der-p-1/Fel-d-1/Can-f-1/Asp-f-1/Alt-a-1). 鼻汁好酸球 (R2) for 条件 1 vs 2 differential. 4-tier treatment ladder: mild → moderate → severe → severe-refractory. yakushi cross-actor dispense for OTC tier (chlorpheniramine Wave 1 / cetirizine + loratadine + diphenhydramine Wave 1b). SLIT 3-5 yr longitudinal cohort tracker (R3). Council Lv6+ ≥3 + ≥1 licensed MD + ≥1 allergist (R3) attestation triggers." :path "90-docs/adr/2605260115-mitate-condition-1-allergic-rhinitis-perennial.md"}
  {:id "2605260130" :title "mitate Wave 1 condition 2 — vasomotor (non-allergic) rhinitis diagnostic + treatment routing (除外診断 + 誘因日記 + 環境調整 advisory)" :status "proposed" :status_note "Sub-ADR for condition 2 (除外診断 — 条件 1/3/4/5 rule-out, IgE 陰性 + 好酸球 <5%; 5-15% 日本成人 prevalence)。誘因日記 (symptom diary) 2-week minimum with 5 trigger categories (寒暖差 / 香水 / 食事 / ストレス / 飲酒)。4-tier treatment ladder: 環境調整 + 鼻うがい → アゼラスチン点鼻 OR 鼻噴霧 steroid → 漢方 + 自律神経整備 → PNN section (R3 surgical referral)。抗コリン点鼻 (イプラトロピウム) 国内未承認 — INN 言及のみ、海外個人輸入は推奨せず (jurisdictional + 安全)。NARES (Non-Allergic Rhinitis with Eosinophilia Syndrome) sub-type は Wave 2+ R3 cohort 内 observed → 別 carve-out。" :path "90-docs/adr/2605260130-mitate-condition-2-vasomotor-rhinitis.md"}
  {:id "2605260145" :title "mitate Wave 1 condition 3 — chronic sinusitis (蓄膿症) diagnostic + treatment routing (内視鏡 + 鼻汁性状 + paranasal CT + ESS surgery planner)" :status "proposed" :status_note "Sub-ADR for condition 3 — **Wave 1 中 最も Rx + surgical routing 重い condition**; mitate R2 pilot で licensed MD-in-loop の最低 case を確立。12-wk gate (12 週間以上連続鼻閉 + 膿性鼻汁 + 顔面圧迫感 + 嗅覚低下) で R1 advisory tier では rule-in 確定不能、必ず escalate-md-otolaryngology。R2 で Hanami robot 鼻内視鏡 + paranasal CT 外部 imaging facility routing + 病型分類 (CRSsNP / CRSwNP / 好酸球性 / 歯性 / 真菌性 — 各 treatment 全く異なる)。マクロライド少量長期 (クラリスロマイシン 200mg ×3ヶ月, Rx) + 鼻うがい + 鼻噴霧 steroid。R3 で ESS (FESS / extended) surgery planner advisory — 2 ENT surgeon + 1 anesthesiologist on Council 要件、surgeon-in-loop 執刀 attestation。好酸球性副鼻腔炎 → 指定難病登録 + デュピルマブ (Rx 高額生物製剤) `escalation = recommend-md-specialist-rhinology`。真菌性副鼻腔炎 (頭蓋内浸潤 risk) G5 emergency screen に red-flag 必須追加 (片側 + 糖尿病 / 免疫低下 + 進行性顔面腫脹)。" :path "90-docs/adr/2605260145-mitate-condition-3-chronic-sinusitis.md"}
  {:id "2605260160" :title "mitate Wave 1 condition 4 — septal deviation (鼻中隔弯曲症) diagnostic + treatment routing (内視鏡 + rhinomanometry + septoplasty routing)" :status "proposed" :status_note "Sub-ADR for condition 4 — 構造的鼻閉; 10-30% prevalence (subclinical 含む); 最も objective measurement-driven。**片側のみ永続** (左右交代しない) が core differential。R2 で Hanami robot 鼻内視鏡 + rhinomanometry (4-phase AAR — Active Anterior Rhinomanometry, bilateral nasal resistance @ 150 Pa) + 弯曲タイプ classification (C / S / spur) + 下鼻甲介肥大 合併評価 (代償性肥大 70%+ 合併)。4-tier treatment: 軽症 = 点鼻 steroid (mometasone / fluticasone) で甲介浮腫減 → 中等症 = + 生活調整 → 重症 = septoplasty + 下鼻甲介手術 (粘膜下切除 / レーザー焼灼) → 重症 + 外鼻変形 = septorhinoplasty (自費〜混合)。ess_surgery_planner cell を ESS と septoplasty 両方で reuse (conditionContext で分岐)。Septoplasty cost transparency (保険適用 10-15 万円 / 高額療養費で実質 4-9 万円, 入院 2-5 日 or 日帰り) は §2(e) anti-paywall の直接 value。" :path "90-docs/adr/2605260160-mitate-condition-4-septal-deviation.md"}
  {:id "2605260175" :title "mitate Wave 1 condition 5 — rhinitis medicamentosa (薬剤性鼻炎) detection + 離脱支援 + yakushi-side naphazoline label警告 loop" :status "proposed" :status_note "Sub-ADR for condition 5 — **religious-corp 内 self-care substrate の最初の完結した closed-loop case**。yakushi が naphazoline (Wave 1 reference triplet 含有) を 製造 → adherent 使用 → mitate detection → 離脱支援 → yakushi G11 label警告 強化 trigger という双方向 constitutional feedback loop。OTC vasoconstrictor (naphazoline / oxymetazoline / tramazoline / phenylephrine) ≥ 7 日連用 auto-detection (medication_history_audit cell)。≥ 14 日連用 → severity = high。離脱 3-tier protocol: tier 1 完全中止 + 鼻噴霧 steroid 置換 (default) / tier 2 片側ずつ中止 / tier 3 漸減 (重症例 + 短期経口 ステロイド Rx)。元 condition (1-4) と condition 5 併存が典型 — triage 再実行で 元 condition treatment を並走。yakushi cross-actor signal: aggregated overuse signal feed → yakushi pharma_post_market_surveillance (G7 + G10 enforce no patient identity);yakushi side label warning 文言 を data-driven に update (世界で稀少な mechanism)。Charter Rider §2(c) 反転 + §2(e) + §2(h) の三位一体 alignment が物理的に成立。" :path "90-docs/adr/2605260175-mitate-condition-5-rhinitis-medicamentosa.md"}
  {:id "2605260200" :title "mitate R1 — self-care advisory PWA (intake + emergency_screen + medication_audit + triage 4 cells active; advisory-only; no 検査 ordering; no Rx; unlimited patient)" :status "proposed" :status_note "R1 phase transition from R0 scaffold (ADR-2605260100 + 5 condition sub-ADRs) to operational advisory tier — first **operational** religious-corp diagnostic + treatment advisory; §2(e) anti-gatekeeping value moves from constitutional declaration to delivered patient experience. **4 cells activate** (rhinitis_intake / emergency_screen / medication_history_audit / rhinitis_triage on Murakumo node `levi`, healthzPort 13070-13073); **9 cells stay gated** (diagnostic ordering + treatment router + SLIT cohort + ESS planner + outcome followup — R2+ scope). R1 advisory returns top-3 condition posterior + escalation = recommend-md-visit / self-care-advisory only — no 検査 ordering, no Rx-specific advice. Patient unlimited (advisory-only marginal cost). 8 silenMitateReview baseline attestations enumerated (charter / G3 disclaimer / G5 emergency keyword / G5 false-negative adversarial / G6 escalation / G11 intake form text / G11 notification channel / 5× condition Bayesian prior). ≥ 1 licensed MD on Council medical advisory required (R1 minimum; R2 requires ≥ 2). 1 emergency medicine specialist required for G5 attestations (R1 critical path). New app carve-out `60-apps/mitate-pwa/` (T3 TS Native, Adherent SBT + passkey + 30-day rotating pseudonym DID, disclaimer-first flow, no streak/score/gamification, push notification only emergency-ack/appointment-reminder/AE-followup 3 channels). Condition 5 (薬剤性鼻炎) detection + 離脱 advisory live; yakushi cross-actor signal aggregation half-live (mitate detects; yakushi-side label-warning update activates R2 via cross-actor baseline). Bias audit methodology baseline registered (no clinical data yet — quarterly schedule + demographic axes + 5% disparity threshold + corrective action mandate). R1 exit criteria → R2 entry: ≥ 100 patient intakes + 0 G5 false negative (10% specialist sampled review) + ≥ 5 positive outcome self-report + monthly bias audit ≤ 10% selection bias + yakushi cross-actor design Council-reviewed + ≥ 2 licensed MD on Council + Hanami robot mech design attestation in flight." :path "90-docs/adr/2605260200-mitate-r1-advisory-self-care-pwa.md"}
  {:id "2605260215" :title "yakushi R1 — cross-actor AE aggregation + dedupe rule (mitate joint; closes naphazoline closed-loop other half; pre-req for mitate R2 + yakushi Wave 1 R2 pilot)" :status "proposed" :status_note "Joint mitate-yakushi ADR closing the **other half** of the naphazoline closed-loop (mitate side ADR-2605260175 §Decision 4 defined the emit; this ADR defines yakushi receive + label warning data-driven update). 4 decisions: (1) aggregated AE payload variant — `aggregationLevel` enum extends `com.etzhayyim.pharma.adverseEventReport` with 'aggregated-lot-window' + 'aggregated-quarter-summary' values mutually exclusive with encryptedPatientIdentityEnvelope (G10 structural); aggregatedPayload struct = yakushiProductDid + lotIdHashRange + window + patientCountDistinct + medianOveruseDurationDays + medianDosesPerDay + withdrawal8weekSuccessRate + severityHistogram + symptomMedDraSocCodes. (2) AE dedupe rule — primary key (lotIdHashed, severityBucket, onsetWeekIso) at yakushi-side single source of truth; mitate emits both individual + aggregated, yakushi decides count; identity-free by design (G7 + G10 structural not policy). (3) Label-warning data-driven update mechanism — 4 thresholds (withdrawal8weekSuccessRate <0.50 / medianOveruseDurationDays >21 / patientCountDistinct >100/quarter / severityHistogram[severe+life-threatening]/total >0.10) trigger label warning re-issue on next lot; quarterly minimum + on-demand maximum cadence; ae-followup push channel (G11 permitted 3-channel) notifies active adherents. (4) Joint silen-review flow — 3 new silenPharmaReview scopes (cross-actor-ae-aggregation-baseline / ae-dedupe-event / label-warning-update-naphazoline) + 3 new silenMitateReview scopes (yakushi-cross-actor-signal-aggregation-baseline / ae-feed-throttle-baseline / label-warning-update-naphazoline-mitate-cosign); per-update pairing within ±7 days. Bootstrap path: schema locked at mitate R1 deploy; aggregation activates with mitate R2 (outcome_qol_followup cell); first label warning data-driven update ~Q1 of mitate R2 cohort (estimated 90-120 days post-R2). Naphazoline label warning text stays at G11 baseline until first quarter accumulates. Mitigations: dedupe key collision (severityBucket + MedDRA SOC secondary check) / label text bloat (G11 template length cap) / adverse selection bias (R2 bias audit metric) / mitate dedupe inversion (cell test enforces no-dedupe-outgoing)." :path "90-docs/adr/2605260215-yakushi-r1-cross-actor-ae-aggregation-mitate-joint.md"}
  {:id "2605260230" :title "Hanami (鼻見) robot — mechanical design + safety validation + FDA Class I/II SaMD-equivalent attestation (mitate R2 critical path)" :status "proposed" :status_note "mitate-native new robotics class (8th by count, owned by mitate not kuni-umi — same pattern as silicon Wave 2 Funamori). Locks R0 design before R1 prototype fabrication. **Mechanical envelope**: 4.0 mm OD flexible scope × 300 mm insertion, distal articulation ±130° 4-way, 1920×1080 @ 60fps CMOS + 110° FOV, 4500K LED ring 100 lumen, 6-DOF arm 600 mm reach 2 kg payload, **0.5 N hardware force cutoff** at scope tip (constitutional limit — motor torque physically constrained, not just firmware), 50 mm/s linear + 30°/s rotational max, ± 0.1 mm position repeatability, autoclave 134°C × 15 min compatible (tip + 50 mm shaft) + chemical sterilization full-length, single-use disposable PLA tip cover for patient contact, foot pedal + voice + emergency stop (< 100 ms reaction). **5×4 safety validation matrix** (mucosal trauma / depth / patient movement / cross-contamination / classifier mis-routing × hardware / firmware / operator UX / ENT specialist remote override). **3-phase validation** (Phase A bench 1000 cycles + autoclave 100 + network isolation; Phase B silicone phantom × 50 + cadaveric × 30 with Cohen κ ≥ 0.7; Phase C community-center clinical first 20 double-attested live + 21-100 async ≤ 24hr). **Jurisdiction attestation** = JP-first PMDA 製造販売届出 (Class II 相当, 業務範囲外 carve-out applicable for community-center use; fallback 製造販売業許可 + 製造業許可 if not adequate); FDA General Wellness Device (Class I + 21 CFR Part 880); EU MDR Class IIa (rule 5 + rule 11 software medical device). **Murakumo-only classifier** = gemma4:e4b vision distill medical variant (open weights G13, training data consent-only + Council-attested IRB-equivalent per G9); network whitelist enforces no commercial vendor inference endpoint reachable. **G4 N≥2 witness** = operator DID + ENT specialist DID always required (R2+); classifier output never patient-displayed without specialist co-sign. **4-phase build path** (R0 design this ADR / R1 prototype Phase A / R2 Phase B+C community-center pilot 100 patient ceiling / R3 multi-site multi-jurisdiction). **G13 open-source** = hardware CAD + firmware + classifier corpus metadata Apache 2.0 + Charter Rider under 50-infra/hanami-robot/ (R1 ADR creates dir); cross-religious-corp manufacturing via silenMitateReview scope `hanami-cross-corp-manufacture-attestation`. Risks: 0.5 N false positives at turbinate edge / PMDA 業務範囲外 path adequacy uncertain / gemma4:e4b vision medical distill does not yet exist (R1 must train) / cadaver source institutional partner new dependency / counterfeit cross-corp manufacturing supply chain." :path "90-docs/adr/2605260230-hanami-robot-mechanical-design-mitate-r2-critical-path.md"}
