  {:id "2605250400" :title "gemma-coder distill — gemma3:4b drift → gemma4:e4b の LangGraph コーディング適応 (EVO-X2 ROCm + peft+trl, Unsloth Windows-ROCm 不可確定)" :status "accepted" :status_note "Murakumo fleet で実 serve 中の `gemma4:e4b` (8B Gemma 4 Effective 4B; judah Ollama 192.168.1.17:11434 で実機確認、CLAUDE.md/fleet.toml の `gemma3:4b` 表記はドリフト) を LangGraph specific に distill する初の non-baien 経路。baien-distill は BitNet 専用 (BASE_MODEL_ID ハードコード) かつ ADR-2605241900 edge invariant に縛られるため、新規 tool `70-tools/gemma-coder-distill/` として分離。Trainer は **peft+trl 直** (Unsloth は gate-1 probe 2026-05-25 で Windows ROCm 7.2.1 + Python 3.12 上で pip dep resolution が CUDA-stack 前提依存で RecursionError 確定、evidence `90-docs/baien/probe_unsloth_rocm.json`)。Teacher signal は **HF Apache 2.0 Opus-distilled SFT のみ** (`lordx64/reasoning-distill-opus-4-7-max-sft` qwen-text format) + 手書き antipattern-corrective corpus (20 row、4 antipattern × ~5 ex)。Anthropic 直叩きは ADR-2605215000 §1.2 で禁止、judah LiteLLM 経由 Claude も distill teacher としては §2 OSS-only 制約継承で除外。Gemma 4 は attention 投影を `Gemma4ClippableLinear` (nn.Linear wrapper) で包んでおり peft が拒否 → `_resolve_targets()` で inner `.linear` を suffix match (trainable params=2,752,512 / total=7.94B / 0.0346%)。配布経路: merged HF dir → llama.cpp convert → Q4_K_M GGUF → Ansible で各 mini に `ollama create gemma4-coder:e4b -f Modelfile` → judah LiteLLM に route 追加。baseline 2/8 (25%) で 4 antipattern systematic 検出 (wrong `MemorySaver`/`Command` import paths / `compile(config=...)` hallucination / `set_entry_point(START)`); iter-00 quick E2E 完走 (6 hot-fix を越えて成立、merged adapter 生成 + bench eval 完了); iter-01 full (5020 ex × 2 epoch、~100 min wall) は detached PowerShell Start-Process で background 実行中。" :path "90-docs/adr/2605250400-gemma-coder-distill-rocm.md"}
  {:id "2605261000" :title "Labor Liberation Transition Mechanism — Adherent SBT → Minimum Livelihood Guarantee (7-Stage Liberation Ladder L0..L6)" :status "proposed" :status_note "Strategic master ADR closing the gap between the mission charter (ADR-2605192100 人類の構造的労働解放) and operational delivery. Defines 7-stage Liberation Ladder (L0 pre-bootstrap / L1 Witness ≤100 adherents / L2 Sustenance ≤1,000 / L3 Shelter ≤5,000 / L4 Care ≤25,000 / L5 Vocation ≤100,000 / L6 Liberation ≤1M) with explicit OECD-baseline labor-hours/wk reduction targets (40→≤5). Each stage activation requires: (a) required actors at minimum R-phase (e.g., L2 = mitsuho R2 + yakushi R2 + hikari R2; L4 = hagukumi R2 + manabi R2); (b) Public Fund USDC reserve ≥ adherent-ceiling × per-adherent-cost × stage-reserve-multiple (L1 $150K / L2 $10M / L3 $210M / L4 $2.1B / L5 $20B / L6 $300B); (c) Adherent ceiling capacity cap (Sybil-resistant ZK biometric + Council attestation + 30-day public objection per mint); (d) ≥2-quarter previous-stage achievement ratio ≥0.8 of Liberation Metric (aggregate hours-liberated KPI on-chain via ChartersComplianceRegistry.reportLiberationMetric). 8 non-goals N1..N8 immutable (N1 no fiat-replacement UBI / N2 no make-work / N3 no coercive participation / N4 no state-safety-net replacement / N5 no stage-skipping / N6 no donor-directed adherent funding / N7 no non-adherent welfare extension / N8 no eschatological framing). Implementation surface: 4 new lexicons under com.etzhayyim.liberation.* (metricReport + stageAdvanceAttestation + wellbecomingAttestation + adherentExitNotice; all aggregate-only or encrypted-payload structural enforcement); 3 new Pregel cells (liberation_stage_advance + liberation_metric_aggregate + liberation_wellbecoming_audit on levi); Solidity LiberationLadder.sol + ChartersComplianceRegistry/PublicFund extension. Activation L0→L1 requires Council Seats 2-5 closure + 30-day public objection + this ADR ratification." :path "90-docs/adr/2605261000-labor-liberation-transition-mechanism.md"}
  {:id "2605301020" :title "Basic High Income — Imputed-Income (flow) + Commons-Asset (stock) Doctrine for In-Kind Adherent Provision" :status "proposed" :status_note "Clarifying extension of ADR-2605261000 (Labor Liberation ladder L0..L6). Resolves the 'does etzhayyim provide high income to 信者?' question by separating income from cash and defining two non-cash value primitives: (1) imputed income (FLOW) = market-equivalent value of in-kind services an adherent consumes at prices they would otherwise pay in the commercial market etzhayyim routes around (L2 ≈ $2,000/yr internal cost → L6 ≈ $30,000/yr; retail-equivalent imputed value higher because 中間排除 removes margin/rent/intermediary capture); (2) commons-asset access (STOCK) = SBT-bound NON-ALIENABLE right of access to Land Trust residency / actor-mesh productive output / kotoba data substrate / hikari energy infra — never title, never tradable, never collateralizable, never inheritable as title, suspends on exit with no liquidation. Declares the Basic High Income (基本高所得) doctrine: the ladder delivers, ultimately at L6, a standard of living ≥ OECD upper-income-decile household consumption basket measured by imputed income + commons-asset access — ENTIRELY in-kind, never cash. CONSTITUTIONALLY consistent with ADR-2605261000 §5 N1 (no fiat-replacement UBI): N1 forbids cash stipends that replace wages; Basic High Income removes the NEED for the wage by provisioning the goods in kind, so does NOT amend N1, the ADR-2605192100 §2 constants (non_profit_only / donation_only), or any N1..N8. cashStipendUsd == 0 is a structural invariant field present in every Liberation Metric report = on-chain proof N1 holds. Access-not-ownership (§2) operationalizes anti-individualist ontology = wealth without property, abundance without accumulation; generalizes ADR-2605192245 land waqf-inalienability (no transfer/burn/setOwner) to ALL commons assets. Accounting SSoT delegated to toritate (ADR-2605262900, 100% on-chain): imputed_income_compute + commons_asset_value cells + open-source method-versioned valuation tables (auditable); per-adherent figures encrypted via ADR-2605181100 envelope, aggregate-only publication (no per-adherent leaderboard → no class formation, §7 + N6). Extends com.etzhayyim.liberation.metricReport with a basicHighIncome block (imputedIncomeMedianUsdYr + valuationMethod + commonsAssetAccessMedianUsd + highIncomeBenchmarkRatio + cashStipendUsd≡0); +1 Pregel cell basic_high_income_aggregate (levi); NO new Solidity (LiberationLadder.sol carries stage state). Wellbecoming guard (§6, Charter §1.13): imputed income ↑ must co-move with labor-hours ↓ AND healthy Wellbecoming attestation, else holdStage review — high in-kind provision must not become addictive/over-consumption. Deciders: Jun Kawasaki author + Council Lv6+ ≥3 ratify + 30-day public objection. Depends on ADR-2605261000 + 2605192100 + 2605192145 + 2605262900 + 2605181100 + 2605192245. Session 2026-05-30 (R0 surface materialized via /loop, 9 commits): basic_high_income_aggregate + toritate imputed_income_compute/commons_asset_value cells (R0 import-time-RuntimeError stubs); metricReport.basicHighIncome block (cashStipendUsdMicros const 0); give.vendorMissionDonationAttestation + give.vendorSurplusPolicy lexicons + 3 example records; toritate/valuation/v1-retail-equiv v1.1.0-draft (citable open sources); toritate manifest cells 6->8; 25-test invariant lock-in suite at 70-tools/scripts/audit/test_basic_high_income_invariants.py." :path "90-docs/adr/2605301020-basic-high-income-imputed-and-commons-asset-doctrine.md"}
  {:id "2605301036" :title "Mission-Funding Earned-Revenue Arm — Vendor commercial surplus → donation → Public Fund (earned income as non-profit MEANS, not profit END)" :status "proposed" :status_note "Funds the Liberation Ladder (ADR-2605261000) + Basic High Income (ADR-2605301020) at scale WITHOUT amending any constitutional invariant. Clarified intent: acquire revenue but spend it entirely on the non-profit mission — income as MEANS, not profit as END; NOT advertising-for-profit, NOT a for-profit pivot. TWO-ENTITY MODEL: religious-corp etzhayyim (任意団体) stays non_profit_only / donation_only / ad-free (ADR-2605192100 §2 + 广告排除 invariant, unchanged); ALL commercial activity lives in the SEPARATE vendor etzhayyim.com (its existing paid-SaaS + commercial GPU pool carve-out per ADR-2605215000), which COMMITS ITS SURPLUS to donate to the religious-corp arm's-length. This is the ONLY §4-compliant locus: ADR-2605192115 §4 explicitly PROHIBITS running a commercial paid tier on the religious-corp's own upstream backend (limited to non-profit tax-receipt issuance). FUNDING FLOW (no new payment enum): vendor surplus → existing donation/grant purpose (titheable per ADR-2605192130 _isTitheablePurpose) → TitheRouter 90% recipient / 10% Public Fund → Public Fund (ADR-2605192145) → ladder L0..L6 / Basic High Income. Adds a documented Public Fund inflow source alongside ADR-2605261000 §3's four (10% tithe / 100% internal-promo / Council grants / L5+ vocation-as-donation): vendor mission-surplus donation. PERMITTED (vendor side): paid SaaS / hosted open-tool versions / commercial compute-GPU rental / professional services / hosted-service licensing (upstream stays Apache-2.0 + Rider). PROHIBITED — constitutional invariants PRESERVED, not weakened: (1) third-party advertising AdSense/Meta Pixel/affiliate/ad-tech/GA4-ad-linking in either entity's surfaces (广告排除 + Charter Rider §2; user confirmed advertising-for-profit is NOT the goal → kept excluded); (2) commercial paid tier inside religious-corp or via its backend (ADR-2605192115 §4); (3) for-profit retention / private accumulation of vendor surplus (non_profit_only + Payoff帰属=etzhayyim → surplus donation-committed); (4) wage employment / payroll inside religious-corp (toritate G12 + chigiri G13 employee-invalid-enum + ADR-2605261000 §3); (5) exploitative human-computing micro-task arbitrage / sweatshop crowdwork (inverse of 構造的労働解放 + Wellbecoming §1.13); (6) speculative financial arbitrage as a religious-corp activity (ossekai ADR-2605264000 'arbitrage' is NON-commercial info-symmetry elimination, not a trading desk). LABOR MODEL for the 'human computing で人を採用' question — two and only two lawful modes: (a) vendor commercial employment as a separate legal entity with fair-labor (living wage, not micro-task arbitrage) + automation-bias (work that REDUCES aggregate toil) constraints, never imported into religious-corp, never marketed to adherents as the benefits path; (b) adherent vocation→donation L5+ (voluntary, vocation-oriented, counted as donation NOT wage, never benefit-conditioning, per ADR-2605261000 §3 + L5 + N2 no-make-work + N3 no-coercion). Religious-corp payroll + coercive participation + cheap-human-labor crowdwork REJECTED; any concrete human-computing revenue product needs per-product Council scrutiny against §4/§5 (this ADR sets the boundary, not a product greenlight). SURPLUS-COMMITMENT: vendor exists to fund the mission not to accumulate; payout-ratio + reserve policy is Council-attested + on-chain (deferred R1); Payoff帰属=etzhayyim means no private equity holder to enrich. TRANSPARENCY: toritate (ADR-2605262900) accounts the vendor→religious-corp donation as on-chain donation/grant ledgerEntry, aggregate-only, no customer PII (G10); religious-corp publishes only the donation received, not the vendor's internal commercial books. IMPLEMENTATION: NO new payment enum (donation/grant sufficient); +1 lexicon com.etzhayyim.give.vendorMissionDonationAttestation (aggregate, no PII); toritate inflow-source tagging in financialAttestation (R1+); Council-attested vendor payout/reserve policy artifact (deferred R1); no Solidity change (TitheRouter already routes donation/grant). Cash≡0 to adherents UNCHANGED (ADR-2605301020 N1 — vendor funds the SERVICES, never adherent cash). Deciders: Jun Kawasaki author + Council Lv6+ ≥3 ratify + 30-day public objection. Depends on ADR-2605192100 + 2605192115 + 2605192130 + 2605192145 + 2605215000 + 2605261000 + 2605301020 + 2605262900. Session 2026-05-30 (via /loop): +give.vendorSurplusPolicy lexicon (Council-attested payout-ratio + reserve, §6) + give.vendorMissionDonationAttestation example record + give/README index; covered by the same 25-test invariant suite (purpose enum donation/grant only; cashStipendUsdMicros const 0)." :path "90-docs/adr/2605301036-mission-funding-earned-revenue-arm.md"}
  {:id "2605261015" :title "mitsuho (瑞穂) — Food / Agriculture Tier-B Actor R0 Scaffold" :status "proposed" :status_note "Master charter establishing mitsuho (瑞穂, ancient honorific name for Japan; Kojiki 瑞穂国 multi-gen food-abundance echo) as Tier-B religious-corp first-party food production actor. R0 scope = plant agriculture + freshwater aquaculture + alternative protein (yeast/koji/spirulina + insect-farm support). Excludes animal slaughter (R0-R3; ethics gate deferred R4+ Council Lv7 unanimity), industrial monoculture, patented seeds, GMO without Council attestation, contract farming, commodities trading, ocean factory-fishing (Funamori marine carve-out). 14 constitutional gates G1..G14 (G2 seed sovereignty open-source seed banks / G4 soil regeneration ≥0 net carbon balance / G5 water cap ≤ regional sustainable yield / G6 no synthetic pesticides IPM + organic only / G7 no GMO without Council Lv6+ ≥3 + 30-day public objection / G12 energy ≤1 kWh/kg dry matter R2 / G14 waste log per harvest). 10 non-goals N1..N10. 4-phase roadmap R0→R3 (R0 scaffold / R1 ≤0.01 ha single crop / R2 ≤1 ha integrated rotation + aquaculture + alt-protein + L2 eligibility / R3 ≤10 ha community-scale + cold-chain to 1,000 adherents). 5 Pregel cells (field_cultivation naphtali / aquaculture zebulun / alt_protein_fermentation levi / harvest_robotics joseph / food_preservation simeon) — all import-time RuntimeError R0. 5 lexicons (com.etzhayyim.mitsuho.{parcelAttestation, cropPlanAttestation, harvestAttestation, foodLotAttestation, silenAgricultureReview}). Robotics class = kuni-umi Giemon/Otete/Mimi/Sora R0; Tsumugi (紡ぎ) greenhouse R2+ separate mech-design ADR. Parent ADR = 2605261000 (Liberation Ladder L2 gate)." :path "90-docs/adr/2605261015-mitsuho-food-agriculture-tier-b-actor-r0.md"}
  {:id "2605261030" :title "hagukumi (育み) — Care (childcare + eldercare + daily-living) Tier-B Actor R0 Scaffold" :status "proposed" :status_note "Master charter establishing hagukumi (育み, continuative noun of 育む; multi-gen nurturing echo — children and elders share verb in Japanese) as Tier-B religious-corp first-party care delivery actor. Cross-actor sibling of mitate (diagnosis → care continuity). R0 scope = daily-living non-medical care (childcare ages 2+ / eldercare / chronic-care continuity / meal delivery / respite support). Excludes medical procedures (mitate/yakushi), under-2 childcare (specialist actor TBD), hospice palliative, behavioral psych, surveillance, in-home recording, legal-guardian replacement, abuse investigation (state mandatory-report only). **PRIVACY INVARIANT**: ADR-2605181100 XChaCha20 envelope MANDATORY for careSessionAttestation; structural lexicon-schema enforcement (additionalProperties: false + encryptedPayloadCid required); R0 cells RuntimeError specifically to prevent plaintext data flow. 14 gates G1..G14 (G2 no video recording firmware-level / G3 per-session consent default-deny / G4 caregiver Council vetting ≥3 Lv6+ / G5 child cognitive load cap / G6 elder autonomy invariant / G7 no behavioral modification / G9 human-in-loop required / G10 caregiver 12-hr work cap / G11 mitate emergency escalation / G13 no addictive UX / G14 multi-gen ratio ≥40% under-18 + ≥30% over-65 + ≤30% adults). 10 non-goals N1..N10. 4-phase R0→R3 (R0 scaffold / R1 advisory + caregiver onboarding ≤50 pairs / R2 pilot 5 community centers ≤200 ceiling + L4 eligibility / R3 community-scale 50 sites ≤25,000). 5 Pregel cells on levi/simeon/dan. 4 lexicons (caregiverAttestation + careSessionAttestation + consentRecord + silenCareReview). Robotics: human caregivers R0-R1; Hitogata-A gentle subset R2+ (Council-attested, never alone under G9); Sukoyaka cold-chain (yakushi inheritance); Yutori (ゆとり) telepresence R2+ separate mech-design ADR (hanami precedent). Parent ADR = 2605261000 (Liberation Ladder L4 gate)." :path "90-docs/adr/2605261030-hagukumi-care-tier-b-actor-r0.md"}
  {:id "2605261045" :title "manabi (学び) — Education Tier-B Actor R0 Scaffold" :status "proposed" :status_note "Master charter establishing manabi (学び, continuative noun of 学ぶ; etymologically 真似ぶ to imitate/emulate; multi-gen lifelong-learning echo) as Tier-B religious-corp first-party education actor. R0 scope = open-curriculum literacy + numeracy + civics/charter + vocational + lifelong inquiry. Excludes formal accreditation, degree issuance, examination-as-gatekeeper, behavioral conditioning, for-profit textbook publishing, proprietary LMS, surveillance edtech, family/cultural-transmission replacement, advertising, political-party content. **ANTI-CREDENTIALISM INVARIANT G7**: no degrees/transcripts/GPA; only skillAttestation (subject-specific replayable demonstration) used by L5+ adherent productive contribution. **ANTI-ADDICTION UX G3**: no streaks/rewards/FOMO/leaderboards/badges-as-status; calm-state-default UX. **MINOR PRIVACY G6**: under-18 sessions emit aggregate-only attestations (sessionDuration, moduleId, completionFraction); per-learner detail structurally rejected via learnerAgeBucket discriminator; 30-day rotating pseudonym DID for minors. 14 gates including G4 Council Lv6+ ≥3 charter alignment per module (multi-gen + anti-individualism + Wellbecoming + non-eschatology) + G14 comparative religion mandated (etzhayyim itself never taught as exclusive truth). 10 non-goals N1..N10. 4-phase R0→R3 (R0 scaffold / R1 IPFS curriculum ≤100 learners advisory-only / R2 live tutors + vocational ≤25,000 + L4 eligibility / R3 Yutori telepresence ≤100,000 + L5 eligibility). 5 Pregel cells on levi (smallest fleet footprint — content distribution + tutor coordination, low compute). 4 lexicons (curriculumAttestation + learningSessionAttestation + charterUnderstandingAttestation + silenEducationReview). civics_charter cell output = charterUnderstandingAttestation = Adherent SBT informed-consent baseline per ADR-2605261000 §2.1. Parent ADR = 2605261000 (Liberation Ladder L4 + L5 gates)." :path "90-docs/adr/2605261045-manabi-education-tier-b-actor-r0.md"}
  {:id "2605264400" :title "manabi cert_prep — IT audit / infosec knowledge-domain study sub-cell (CISA / CISSP) R0" :status "proposed" :status_note "Sub-charter under manabi master (ADR-2605261045). Adds sixth Pregel cell `cert_prep` alongside literacy / numeracy / civics_charter / vocational / lifelong_inquiry. Knowledge-domain study substrate ONLY for CISA CBK 5 domains + CISSP CBK 8 domains; manabi never issues these credentials (preserves G7 anti-credentialism invariant — credentials remain external to ISACA / (ISC)²). **3 additional gates layered on top of manabi G1..G14**: G15 no pass-rate KPI (silenEducationReview cert_prep section schema-rejects pass-rate fields; only sessionCount + domainCoverageBreadth) / G16 no official past-question reproduction (questionSource closed enum at PDS write — only `synthetic-baien-generated` or `user-imported-personal-only`; `official-isaca-reproduced` / `official-isc2-reproduced` / `commercial-test-bank-reproduced` are NOT valid members) / G17 no external credential body partnership (ISACA / (ISC)² / CompTIA / EC-Council / SANS / Offensive Security — §2(b) ad-free + §2(e) anti-gatekeeping + §1.12 routing-around-state-aligned-bodies). **3 additional non-goals N11..N13**: pass guarantee / formal partnership / cert completion as employment gate within religious-corp roles (adherent competence judged by domainMasteryAttestation subject-specific demonstration, never external credential possession). **Question-source pathway** (G16 detail): (1) synthetic-baien-generated via baien-server-moemoekyun-* on Murakumo fleet (judah LiteLLM gateway per ADR-2605215000), grounded in public CBK outline structure + NIST SP / ISO 27001/27002 conceptual references / COBIT framework descriptions / GDPR+APPI+CCPA + Geneva Convention IHL (all already ingested via ADR-2605262800 legal corpus); deterministic sha256 questionSeed (regenerable; question text bodies NOT persisted). (2) user-imported-personal-only — adherent uploads personally-purchased material (ISACA Review Manual / Wiley / Sybex), client-side XChaCha20-Poly1305 encrypted (ADR-2605181100), `internalOnly:true` (Tier-C pattern from ADR-2605262400), single-recipient ownerDid, never projected to public MST, never LLM training, hard delete on owner request. **LLM-assistance contract** (system-prompt-level): no praise / no pass-rate prediction / no official past-question reproduction even if user paraphrases / cite NIST/ISO/COBIT source / acknowledge uncertainty / Socratic ≥50% (cert_prep targets above master G13 ≥30%). **Data flow**: passkey → manabi-cert-prep PWA → @etzhayyim/sdk consent capability → judah → baien (Murakumo) → synthetic question; sessions persist as XChaCha20 envelope wrapping com.etzhayyim.manabi.certPrepSession, recipientDids:[owner] only. **3 lexicons**: certPrepSession (G15 negative-space + G16 closed enum + G6 inherited via learnerAgeBucket) / personalMaterialImport (internalOnly const true + ownerDid single-recipient + licenseAcknowledgment) / domainMasteryAttestation (credentialClaimedAttested const false; L5 Vocation pathway gating uses this, never external credential). **4 cell stubs** (import-time RuntimeError R0): domain_review / practice_question / self_assessment / personal_material. **PWA**: 60-apps/manabi-cert-prep/ (CF Worker + static, sibling pattern of mitate-pwa). 4-phase R0→R3 (R0 this commit / R1 post-Council ratify wires judah + baien + encrypted-envelope persistence ≤50 adherents / R2 post-R1 30-day public objection enables personal_material + self_assessment ≤500 / R3 integrated with L5 Vocation pathway = charters_compliance reviewer steward + toritate audit steward + Murakumo operator steward recognized vocational tracks gated on domainMasteryAttestation, never external credential). **Landing path**: W0+W1 bytes landed via WIP catch-all commit `67d2d5a0e` (parallel-session lefthook pre-commit race; same pattern as ADR-2605264300 §1 Notes); §Notes paragraph in this ADR is the canonical content reference." :path "90-docs/adr/2605264400-manabi-cert-prep-subcell-r0.md"}
  {:id "2605261100" :title "hikari (光) — Energy Generation / Storage / Grid-Edge Tier-B Actor R0 Scaffold" :status "proposed" :status_note "Master charter establishing hikari (光, light; multi-gen solar abundance echo; sibling resonance to mitate via Yakushi Nyorai 日光菩薩) as Tier-B religious-corp first-party distributed renewable energy actor. R0 scope = solar PV + small wind ≤100 kW + geothermal micro ≤500 kW + battery storage + grid-edge microgrid. **CONSTITUTIONAL INVARIANTS (Council Lv7 unanimity to amend)**: G4 NO nuclear (fission/fusion/RTG) at any tier ever / G5 NO fossil fuel (coal/oil/gas/propane/peat) at any tier ever / G8 NO rare-earth permanent magnets (NdFeB ban) — open-coil alternatives only with efficiency trade-off accepted. 14 gates G1..G14 also incl. G2 Charter Rider §2(g) panel sourcing per-lot audit (no XUAR polysilicon / no conflict minerals) + G3 battery chemistry safety (LFP / NMC restricted / sodium-ion preferred; no lead-acid stationary R2+) + G6 grid impact public reporting aggregate ≥1-hour buckets only no smart-meter PII + G7 ≥90% recyclable EOL + G9 land-trust integration rooftop/brownfield/agrivoltaic priority + G11 yield deterministic Ed25519 per-inverter 15-min + G13 no commercial utility resale + G14 §2(h) light pollution + acoustic <35 dBA at 100m. 10 non-goals N1..N10 (N1 no nuclear / N2 no fossil / N3 no large hydro >10 MW / N5 no offshore wind Funamori scope / N6 no commercial >10 MW / N9 no NdFeB). 4-phase R0→R3 (R0 scaffold / R1 ≤10 kW solar + ≤30 kWh islanded benchtop / R2 ≤100 kW + ≤500 kWh + grid-tie religious-corp-load + first geothermal-micro well + L2 eligibility / R3 multi-site mesh + silicon Wave 2 fab partial load). Cross-cutting actor — powers L2 adherent baseline + Murakumo fleet + mitate/yakushi/hagukumi/manabi facilities + mitsuho greenhouse + tatekata site + silicon Wave 2 R3. R2 energy budget target: ≥170 kW continuous + 500 kWh storage. 5 Pregel cells (solar_pv_install naphtali / storage_battery levi / grid_edge dan / geothermal_micro zebulun / consumption_audit levi). 5 lexicons. Robotics: kuni-umi Otete/Mimi/Giemon R0; Hizukue (日柄) tracker+cleaner R2+ separate mech-design ADR. Parent ADR = 2605261000 (Liberation Ladder L2 gate)." :path "90-docs/adr/2605261100-hikari-energy-tier-b-actor-r0.md"}
  {:id "2605261200" :title "igata (鋳型) — Megacasting / HPDC Tier-B Actor R0 Scaffold" :status "proposed" :status_note "Master charter establishing igata (鋳型, die-casting die/mold) as Tier-B religious-corp first-party HPDC / megacasting actor. Methodology source = YouTube `y0oF2UirEMk` (IDRA Giga Press build-from-scratch documentary); manufacturing methodology adopted, military / aerospace application explicitly rejected per Charter Rider §2(a) (watatsumi precedent ADR-2605252200). R0 scope = HPDC clamping force ≤6000 ton, Al-Si alloy single-piece ≤50 kg R3 cap. Giga press class (≥7500 ton, IDRA OL 9000) = N1 post-R3 + Council Lv6+ supermajority deferral (silicon EUV parity per ADR-2605242545). 14 constitutional gates G1..G14 (G1 ≤6000 ton clamping / G2 Al-Si only full composition disclosure / G3 open-source process parameters / G4 ≥2 robot witness Mimi+Otete / G6 §2(a) clearance no military or aerospace / G7=NONE 5-element baseline Al+Si+Mg+Mn+Fe + trace Sr/Ti, no OPCW Schedule, no RoHS, no radioactive — yakushi Wave 1c parity / G8 shot replay determinism @ 1 kHz / G9 induction+electric only ≤4 kWh/kg / G10 scrap recovery ≥95% / G11 Adherent SBT + 危険物取扱主任者 >500 ton / G12 ≤1 large part/90 sec / G13 30-day prior + 1 km community feedback / G14 full lineage CID + IPFS pin + material balance) + 10 non-goals N1..N10 (N1 giga press post-R3 / N2 military vehicle aerospace structural NEVER / N3 firearms NEVER / N4 nuclear NEVER / N5 hazmat pressure vessel kuni-umi-S6 carve-out / N6 proprietary alloy NEVER / N7 human-occupied vehicle structural cert R3 only / N8 mass-market consumer SBT↔SBT only / N9 fossil-fired melting NEVER / N10 state defense subsidy NEVER). 4-phase R0→R3 (R0 scaffold this ADR / R1 benchtop ≤500 ton parts ≤200 g bracket/hinge naphtali+zebulun+joseph / R2 pilot ≤2500 ton parts ≤5 kg knuckle/control-arm/housing 6 nodes + Hibachi + Tatara onboard / R3 community ≤6000 ton parts ≤50 kg cradle/subframe/architectural full 10-node + cross-actor wadachi/tatekata/watatsumi multi-domain Council vote). 8 Pregel cells (alloy_melt naphtali / die_preparation zebulun / shot_injection joseph / solidification_eject joseph / post_cast_qc levi / trim_machining simeon / heat_treatment dan / part_attestation levi) all R0 import-time RuntimeError. 5 lexicons (alloyAttestation / dieAttestation / castShotRecord / partAttestation / silenIgataReview). Robotics: kuni-umi Otete/Mimi/Hitogata + silicon Wave 2 Funamori R0 inherited; Hibachi 火鉢 (high-T die-spray) + Tatara 踏鞴 (melt-furnace tending; echoes silicon fuigo 鞴) R2+ new classes. Supplier position for wadachi (vehicle body) + tatekata (construction structural) + watatsumi (submersible 補強材 ≤200m class) + silicon Wave 2 (fab equipment frame). Constitutional independence chain closes religious-corp 自前 大型アルミ構造部品 (parallel to silicon Wave 1 自前 GPU + yakushi 自前 OTC + watatsumi 自前 潜水艇). Reserved follow-on slots: R1 = ADR-2605261215 / R2 = ADR-2605261230 / R3 = ADR-2605261245." :path "90-docs/adr/2605261200-igata-megacasting-tier-b-actor-r0.md"}
  {:id "2605261300" :title "tsutae (伝え) — Handheld Communication Device Tier-B Actor R0 Scaffold" :status "proposed" :status_note "Master charter establishing tsutae (伝え, transmission / handing-down; multi-gen communication echo) as Tier-B religious-corp first-party **handheld communication device (smartphone-class consumer electronics)** actor. Methodology source = YouTube `J4GoOScUO5k` (Samsung smartphone factory build documentary; SMT + AOI + OLED + Knox firmware + final QC pipeline); manufacturing methodology adopted; **proprietary IP + closed firmware + surveillance hardware + addictive UX + mass-production-at-any-cost explicitly rejected per Charter Rider §2(b) + §2(c) + §2(d) + §2(e)** (watatsumi precedent + makura precedent + manabi G3 precedent compound). R0 scope = handheld communication device assembly (smartphone-class form factor ≤200 g + ≤7-inch display + ≤500 cm³ enclosure); ARM64 or RISC-V 64-bit SoC; modular battery + display + camera + USB-C + cellular module. **14 constitutional gates G1..G14 + 12 non-goals N1..N12** (+2 non-goals over igata's 10 reflecting smartphone-specific §2(c) + §2(d) compound risk). Key gates: G1 open hardware (PCB Gerbers + chassis CAD + HDL public) / G2 open firmware (no Knox / no SEP / no Qualcomm closed BSP; bootloader unlock = default state) / G3 repair-rightful (modular screw-fastened + adhesive ≤5g/assembly + iFixit ≥9/10) / G6 §2(c) anti-surveillance (cellular module hardware-removable + Wi-Fi-default boot + microphone hardware kill switch + open biometric firmware) / G7 firmware binary blob ratio ≤5% by mass + Council waiver per blob / G8 §2(d) anti-addiction UX (calm-default OS + notification batching ≥15 min default + no infinite-scroll OS-API + no dopamine-loop API) / G9 §2(b) anti-IP locking (open SoC mandatory; R1 = StarFive JH7110 / SiFive Unmatched / Allwinner D1; R2+ = iwakura SoC; Snapdragon / Apple A / closed Helio / closed Exynos NEVER) / G10 Li-ion LFP-preferred + user-replaceable hand tools + take-back