  {:id "2606092000" :title "tsumugi scale-agnostic 産官学報 concentration (A) + 旗 hata ideology/faction dimension (B)" :status "accepted" :status_note "Answers 「地域・国・思想・組織ごとの意識的な power dynamics もすべて精微か。例えば長崎では三菱の方・県庁の人・長崎新聞のやつなどの local dynamics」. Audit of the power-mirror lineage (tsumugi/keizu/danjo/kanae/tadori/ooyake/kabuto/kosatsu) found two gaps + one constitutional boundary: (1) tsumugi's seed is national/keiretsu-scoped — the 取-concentration lens was never run at local/regional/intra-org scale nor over 学会; (2) the diachronic thought-streams (ADR-2606061500) were never projected to the PRESENT as the conscious/declared ideology axis; (3) the ask reaches for NAMED PRIVATE INDIVIDUALS (『三菱の方・新聞のやつ』) which G1/keizu-G1 no-doxxing make unrepresentable — this ADR makes the SEAT/INSTITUTION-level local + ideological dynamics precise while keeping persons out. Per founder structural choice: EXTEND tsumugi in place, NO new actor; (B) named 旗 (hata). (A) scale-agnostic 産官学報: 00-contracts/schemas/power-scale-ontology.kotoba.edn (:pwr/* with :pwr/scale {global→supranational→national→regional→local→intra-org} + :pwr/sector {san官学報民金} + :pwr/locality; :tie/* factual 縁) + methods/analyze_scale.py (pure stdlib; per-locality & per-scale edge-primary cross-sector integral × diversity + cross-sector brokers) + data/seed-scale-power.kotoba.edn (3 instances/3 scales: 長崎 local 産官学報 flagship + 学会 intra-org + national keiretsu; all :representative structural-public facts). FIVE invariants S1 edge-primary (no :pwr/power-score) · S2 person-excluded (:pwr/standing ∈ {institutional,public-seat}; :private-person raises) · S3 aggregate-first · S4 sourcing ≥2 · S5 non-adjudicating (癒着/談合/capture unrepresentable) · S6 map-not-target. FIRST RUN: jp.nagasaki top cluster (all 4 産官学報 woven, concentration 12.08; 三菱重工長崎造船所 top broker span 3). (B / 旗 hata): 00-contracts/schemas/banner-ontology.kotoba.edn (:banner/* descriptive standard ← :banner/thought-stream genealogy; :ent/* public org/seat/self; :flies/* alignment 縁) + methods/analyze_banner.py (per-banner reach integral → camps → bridges(H6) → genealogy) + data/seed-banner.kotoba.edn (textbook 主義 banners tied to streams + SELF-DECLARED party platforms on 改憲↔護憲 + etzhayyim self-node inbound-only; NO corporate/newspaper/person ideology labels — G7-gated). THE THOUGHT-POLICING GUARD H1–H7 (3 sites each + 11 tests): H1 public-declared basis only (:inferred/:suspected/:imputed raise) · H2 non-adjudicating no-threat-token (:extremist/:過激/:危険思想 unrepresentable; no threat-level/loyalty) · H3 edge-primary no-conviction-score · H4 person-excluded (not a belief registry) · H5 mirror+symmetric (etzhayyim flies own Charter banner inbound-only) · H6 plural (≥2-banner = bridge) · H7 sourcing ≥2. 22/22 new tests green (11 scale + 11 banner). ZERO dependency added (pure stdlib, pywasm-ready); additive cells, no change to existing tsumugi behaviour. Honest R0: :representative bounded seeds (学会X/政党A·B·C are representative placeholders, not assertions about named orgs; grasping-load/weight illustrative); named-individual layer stays OUT by constitutional design (G1 no-doxxing); live locality + entity↔banner ingest G7+Council+operator-gated; Murakumo-only narration (G6). LANDED 2026-06-09 (PR #1502, squash): a session /loop detailed the intel over 12 waves — :pwr/scale exercised end-to-end across ALL 7 tiers (global IMF/BIS → supranational EU → national → regional 都道府県 → municipal 市区町村 → local → intra-org); :pwr/collective-kind axis added, all 8 kinds populated (組織/企業単位·地域·市区町村·コミュニティ·社内派閥·学閥·系列·審議会); 8 cluster TYPES (企業城下町/金融街/サイエンスパーク/学閥/社内派閥/系列/超国家/惑星金融); all 6 sectors; 8 regions (JP/DE/KR/US/UK/TW/EU/global); flagship 企業城下町 豊田市 (本社 employs/funds/seats 市); honest density 愛知13.2>長崎12.08>豊田市9.3>Detroit8.32>…; cross-scale VERTICAL-integration readout (:pwr/parent chains — Toyota threads 国→市→社内, 3 scales). (B) grew to 6 axes/13 banners (改憲/原発/自由貿易/金融 + 主義 schools) with multi-issue pluralism bridges + thought-stream genealogy. Murakumo setup made literal: methods/narrate.py (fleet-only G6, operator-gated, dry-run) + in-WASM deploy/agent.py (kotoba_langgraph→KotobaLLM→host MURAKUMO_DEFAULT_MODEL gemma4) emit a fused intel-digest.kotoba.edn + an append-only intel-datoms.kotoba.edn (EAVT canonical-state shape, ADR-2605312345), published=false (G7). Final tests 24 scale + 11 banner + 16 narrate green; CodeQL×8 + lint-and-test + monorepo-health green. Constitutional boundary held: named private individuals unrepresentable (G1/keizu-G1); all seat/institution-level, :representative, non-adjudicating. LANDED WAVE 2 2026-06-10 (G7 live ingest + self-expanding promotion loop; each Council ratification ENACTED AS A PR): coverage_scale.py honest gap audit (PR #1529, Gemini-CLI authored under delegation, reviewed vs Codex-CLI) · ingest_scale.py G7-gated Wikidata-P749 live ingest through the S1/S2/S4/S5 membrane, seed NEVER auto-mutated (PR #1532) · promotion ladder P1 #1534 (curated; WDQS perf fix — unanchored LIMIT returned the Prague school tree, vetted subset only) → P2 #1537 (--anchored, 10 seed-org QIDs → connected subsidiaries, PARENT_ALIASES) → P3 #1556 (--ring2 SELF-EXPANDING: derive_seed_qids harvests anchors from the seed's own citation URLs, 189 anchors, grandchildren) → P4 #1574 (--gleif SECOND SOURCE: GLEIF L2 RR, curated VERIFIED LEIs + runtime legalName guard; landed while WDQS was in outage) → P5 #1579 (ring-3 after WDQS recovery, great-grandchildren). Seed 72→619 nodes / 631 ties; country coverage 4.1%→20.5%; ingest tests →24 (hermetic WDQS/GLEIF fixtures). WDQS outage rate-limit RESPECTED (deferred via scheduled retries, never circumvented); the wait built the GLEIF second source (no single point of failure). Standing loop: measure → fetch (ring-N ∪ gleif) → vet → promote via PR (= Council ratification) → next ring's anchors self-enrich." :path "90-docs/adr/2606092000-tsumugi-scale-agnostic-and-hata-banner-power-dynamics.md" :adr ["2606092000" "2606011800" "2606061500" "2606011000" "260