  {:id "2606091800" :title "basic-infrastructure robotics — 3-layer operational substrate (電気/水道/ガス/通信)" :status "accepted" :status_note "Answers 「電気水道ガス通信などの基本インフラを運営設計する robotics の設計はどれぐらいできているか / 実際に稼働する前提まで進めて」. Audit: wide scaffolding, almost no runnable robotics — every domain cell.py .solve() raised RuntimeError; the open-ot IEC 61499 Rust WASM PLC (8 BFBs) connected to nothing; kuni-umi commissioning/cell.py raised NotImplementedError at the open-ot seam; kami-engine submodule un-checked-out; only real control code = noroshi's fibre aligner. Built ONE shared 3-layer substrate at orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-kuni-umi/robotics/ (stdlib, deterministic, :representative): plant (MicrogridPlant swing-eqn+SoC, FirstOrderPlant — the kami-genesis stand-in) + control (PID anti-windup / Droop / DroopPI / simulate() — the open-ot field-tier floating-point twin) + kinematics (PlanarArm FK + analytic IK + joint_trajectory) + safety (closed-world civilian allowlist N1 · require_member_signature no-server-key G15/G7 · witness_quorum_ok ≥2 G8 · SafetyEnvelope human-proximity joint-rate ceiling) + commissioning (kuni-umi→open-ot handoff: droop-P-f load-step acceptance + windowed ROCOF guard → dry-run loop-DID registration; the NotImplementedError seam now delegates to it, live XRPC deps.sdk-gated). Replicated across 4 verticals, each safety crux structural: hikari 電気 (droop+PI restores 50 Hz after a load step; ROCOF trips islanding-scale; Otete panel-install reach/IK/envelope) · mizuho 水道 (reservoir PI; chlorination residual HARD-clamped ≤4.0 mg/L WHO/EPA via doser-clamp + plant-ceiling defence-in-depth; G6 fluoride per-member consent; G3 community-scale cap) · kamado ガス/精製 (PI purge drives H₂S/benzene below entry limits; entry into an un-purged zone raises SafetyError before any motion; G3 decommission-only; G9 displacement cohort) · noroshi 通信 (fibre lay→align→splice reusing the EXISTING Hooke-Jeeves aligner + IEC 60825 gate; fusion splice ≤0.10 dB; weapon laser unenergisable). No-live-actuation preserved: all cell.py .solve() Council-gated; every record server_held_key=false + dry_run=true; stdlib-only, no hardware/network; open-ot stays the hard-RT SSoT under a certified IEC 61508/61511 PLC. LANDED 2026-06-10 (PR #1531 squash 19e8e702e7), 375 tests green. FOLLOW-UP LANDED (PR #1538, kami-physics-bridge): submodule populated; kami-bridge/ Rust crate (path-deps, no submodule edits) emits a deterministic golden FK/IK trace from the REAL kami-genesis Featherstone solver (2-link parity URDF with exact PlanarArm((1.2,1.0)) geometry + real giemon_arm6 6-DOF fixture); committed golden + test_kami_parity.py (+8) prove FK parity on a 56-sample grid, Rust IK solutions verify under Python FK, Python analytic ik2 solves every reachable target (incl. one DLS stall — recorded asymmetry), giemon_arm6 6-DOF ready (limits sane, FK in workspace, position-IK <1mm) → the ADR's 'mechanical swap' promise is proven, 383 tests green. Honest: lumped-parameter :representative plants, test-tuned gains; R1 device-in-the-loop needs each actor's R1 trigger list." :path "90-docs/adr/2606091800-infra-robotics-3layer-operational-substrate.md" :adr ["2606091800" "2605201400" "2605261100" "2605263100" "2606051500" "2606051600" "2605215000" "2605312345" "2605231525"]}
