  {:id "2606073201" :title "meyasu (目安) — unified arbitrage / supply-demand intel orchestrator (統合 arbitrage actor); fuses kakaku spread/supply-demand + mitooshi forecast distribution + ossekai aggregate-first publication into one public-good buyer-transparency + supply-resilience surface" :status "proposed" :status_note "The 統合 arbitrage アクター named in the price-intel gap audit. did:web:meyasu.etzhayyim.com (orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-meyasu/), a THIN ORCHESTRATOR (a 目安 = yardstick, NOT a trade) that computes no price or forecast math itself but FUSES three siblings: kakaku 価格 (cross-merchant/region price SPREAD + present supply/demand index, ADR-2605091200) + mitooshi 見通し (forecast DISTRIBUTION of that index, ADR-2606051800) + ossekai 御節介 (aggregate-first publication discipline, ADR-2605264000). 3 cells over one kotoba Datom graph: fuse (handle_fuse — per-product {kakaku, mitooshi} -> unified arbitrage-intel card: spread, supply/demand now, forecast BAND, trajectory tightening/easing/stable, attention flag, planner route; a point-asserted or speculative forecast is REFUSED, G2) + publish (handle_publish — cards -> aggregate-first post + planner handoff for attention cards; broadcast operator-gated, default :draft) + persist (handle_persist + card_to_datoms — flatten cards into kotoba Datoms over kotoba/schema.edn :meyasu.card/* :meyasu.post/*; tx RETURNED not written without operatorRef, no-server-key; forecast persisted as :forecast-band-lo/hi, never a point). 6 gates: G1 non-speculative (intent buyer-transparency+supply-resilience; emits no trade/price target; :trade/:speculation are NOT representable in the card intent — speculation structurally unrepresentable, Charter §1.3 + yobel) + G2 distribution-respecting (consumed forecast MUST be a distribution point_asserted false with a resilience use; point/speculative refused per-item) + G3 aggregate-first (published intel anonymized aggregate) + G4 non-adjudicating (attention cards routed to a planner okaimono buyers / danjo resilience; meyasu states, planner decides) + G5 Murakumo-only inference (kotoba llm host binding) + G6 no-server-key (publication + persist operator-gated). Lexicons com.etzhayyim.apps.meyasu.{card,post}. Self-driving kotoba/deploy.sh (blocking test gate) + path-scoped .github/workflows/meyasu-test.yml. Cohort END-TO-END test (test_cohort_e2e.py) proves kakaku -> mitooshi -> meyasu composes leak-free across actor boundaries. COMPANION work same session/PR: kakaku offer-ingest extraction pipeline (JSON-LD -> selector -> meta -> Murakumo; live fetch G11-gated) + mitooshi quantile (pinball-scored) forecaster + okaimono live USDC + TitheRouter settlement broadcast (member-signed, no-server-key) + ossekai 8/8 cells complete + onion -> kotoba-kqe migration (ADR-2606071800; removes last createKyselyDb/Hyperdrive read-path violation) + onion BPMN crawl worker re-homed as a py-kotodama primitive running in a kotoba-wasm component (Datom-native, operator-gated Tor fetch). Deciders: Jun Kawasaki. Depends on ADR-2605091200 + 2606051800 + 2606012100 + 2605264000 + 2606071800 + 2605262130 + 2605312345 + 2605215000." :path "90-docs/adr/2606073201-meyasu-unified-arbitrage-intel-orchestrator.md"}
  {:id "2606082101" :title "Tailscale SSH mesh for the Murakumo Mac-mini fleet — keyless, tailnet-SSO-gated operator remote access (control-plane overlay; not a substrate primitive)" :status "proposed" :status_note "Records the operator control-plane overlay for the Mac-mini fleet (ADR-2605191346). Tailscale (WireGuard mesh) + Tailscale SSH on every node: port 22 on the tailnet interface is served by the tailnet-identity SSH server, authorized by a tailnet ACL ssh rule (action=accept, src=autogroup:member, dst=autogroup:self, users=autogroup:nonroot). KEYLESS — no per-node authorized_keys, no distributed SSH private keys, no passwords; access granted/revoked centrally; aligns with the no-server-key spirit (ADR-2605231525) because a tailnet IDENTITY, not a stored key, authorizes each session. Enrollment uses a one-off/ephemeral tailnet auth key held only in Keychain + 1Password, never committed (handled like the DID private key). Login convention: local account == node hostname (<tribe>); primary node = operator handle. SCOPE BOUNDARY (load-bearing): control-plane ONLY — carries no inference, no kotoba Datom state, and no signing; does NOT replace the langserver 10.99.0.0/16 data-plane mesh, the geth/IPFS/Base substrate, or the Murakumo-only inference path (ADR-2605215000). Trade-off: the login.tailscale.com coordination server is a third-party control-plane dependency (data plane stays peer-to-peer WireGuard); the de-SaaS exit is self-hosted Headscale (deferred). Secrets hygiene: no auth keys, passwords, tailnet IPs (100.64.0.0/10 CGNAT ephemeral), or local usernames recorded in-repo. Deciders: Jun Kawasaki. Depends on ADR-2605191346 + 2605215000 + 2605231525." :path "90-docs/adr/2606082101-tailscale-ssh-fleet-operator-access-overlay.md"}
  {:id "2606082102" :title "shiori 栞 — human-Wellbecoming detractor observatory + transparent intervention" :status "accepted" :status_note "Tier-B actor: the 取-concentration HUMAN side of the KG-mirror lineage (inochi/asobi/hokorobi/tsugite). Weaves cohorts(aggregate)/detractors(structural)/drivers(patterns)/mitigators(havens) into the kotoba Datom log; edge-primary detraction vs relief routed to RELIEF (救い); surfaces relief-gap per cohort (→ossekai), 取-holder driver concentration (→danjo/tsumugi/keizu), intervention-design gap. G1 = relief map NEVER per-person affect/manipulation (cohort-only, drivers are PATTERNS not entities, anti-addictive); G8 = transparent-intervention only — shiori PROPOSES, ossekai CARRIES (on-chain-logged + consent-bound), permitted channels = public app.bsky.feed.post + actor-bound email with FULL body disclosed. R0 scaffold + wellbecoming-ontology + seed(39 nodes/55 縁) + pure-stdlib pywasm-ready methods + 11 tests green. ZERO Charter amendments." :path "90-docs/adr/2606082102-shiori-wellbecoming-detractor-mirror.md"}
  {:id "2606082400" :title "Charter-Rider §2(c) — the reciprocity axis (相互監視 affirmed; monetized/asymmetric surveillance prohibited)" :status "accepted" :status_note "Tier-1 Derived-Policy amendment (ADR-2606062100 §3), ratified by Council Lv7+ unanimity (founder 1/1) with a clean priority-conformance attestation. Reframes §2(c) from v3.0's 'commercial vs care' axis to the RECIPROCITY axis: surveillance is prohibited when MONETIZED (revenue from collection/brokerage/SALE of natural-persons' data) OR ASYMMETRIC (one-sided accumulation by a watcher-unwatched, even absent sale); AFFIRMED when RECIPROCAL/symmetric — 相互監視, the 村社会 condition where everyone is equally known + watched (governance/force/tithe themselves plaintext-public), which DETERS crime+不正 and ENDS isolation (見守り; 孤独死 resisted) — the social form of 神の監視 + 相互見守り. Privacy preserved by ENCRYPTION not forgetting (暗号化≠忘却). Rider v3.0→v3.1 (§2(c) clause only). NOTICE re-stamp DONE (PR #1487): charter-rider-applicator now version-aware (verify.sh derives current version from CHARTER-RIDER.md + flags stale stamps), 407/407 NOTICE files at v3.1 (0 stale), NOTICE-only (no ADR/README historical refs touched); ~284 never-stamped packages = separate first-stamp pass (tracked). Deciders: Jun Kawasaki. Depends on ADR-2605192100 + 2605192200 + 2606062100 + 2605252300." :path "90-docs/adr/2606082400-charter-mutual-surveillance-reciprocity-clarification.md"}
  {:id "2606091000" :title "infra-intel / observatory actors — autonomous Murakumo-fleet heartbeat + local kotoba Datom-log persistence (shionome pattern)" :status "proposed" :status_note "Generalizes the shionome (ADR-2606072200) autonomous-heartbeat + local-kotoba-persistence pattern across 11 infra-intel / observatory actors so they self-run on the Mac-mini fleet and persist to append-only content-addressed kotoba Datom logs. Each actor gains methods/kotoba.py (a commit-DAG: graph_datoms + derived_datoms -> make_tx(tx_id,as_of,prev_cid) -> append_tx/read_log/head_cid/verify_chain; :db/add-only EAVT, 非終末論; CID = sha256(prev ‖ canonical-json(datoms)), tamper-evident) + methods/autorun.py (deterministic, resume-safe observe->analyze->persist heartbeat; cycle index drives tx_id+as_of, no wall clock) + methods/test_autorun.py (hermetic: commit-DAG verify, tamper-detect, determinism, append-only, the actor's defining invariant, no-external-I/O) + an ingest/weave/persist cron-cell trio in fleet.toml. Actors + defining invariants preserved structurally: ipaddress (determinism); yabai (G6/G10 plaintext-access hard-stop); tadori (G3/G12 — silenTadoriReview self-audit; no case/PII/obs autonomously persisted; nonzero counter HALTS persisting nothing); sukashi (G2/G4 observatory non-adjudicating, fraud signals :synthesized); watatsuna (G2 resilience-not-interdiction); watari (G4 no-person-tracking); kabuto (G2 + _canonical_order determinism fix); kanjō (G2/G4/G5 no-forecast, :synthesized); danjo (G4 derived_datoms raises on verdict token); keizu (G1 no-doxxing + G4 non-adjudicating co-occurrence); kosatsu (G1/G2 etzhayyim authors no designation, every designation ATTRIBUTED, neutral divergence class). DETERMINISM CAVEAT (load-bearing): analyzers that build derived lists by iterating PYTHONHASHSEED-randomized sets had per-process CID drift; autorun._canonical_order sorts datoms by canonical JSON before hashing (EAVT is unordered, so semantics-preserving) where observed (kabuto/keizu/kosatsu); all 11 verified stable under PYTHONHASHSEED=random. WHAT STAYS GATED: loops do no external I/O (offline ingest, LOCAL persist); live ingest (G7) + live-node push / social posting (G8/G10/G11) remain Council Lv6+ + operator + member-signature gated — one human gate-flip away. 32 collision-free off-:00/:30 cron cells across issachar/dan/simeon/zebulun/judah/benjamin/levi/naphtali. Substrate-clean (no RisingWave/SQL; kotoba Datom log only, N7); Murakumo-only inference untouched; no platform-held key (the loop signs nothing). Generated logs git-ignored (regenerated by autorun.py); only code+tests+fleet placement committed. Implemented in PR #1474. Deciders: Jun Kawasaki. Depends on ADR-2606072200 + 2605262130 + 2605312345 + 2605215000 + 2605231525." :path "90-docs/adr/2606091000-infra-intel-observatory-autonomous-heartbeat-kotoba-persistence.md"}
  {:id "2606082000" :title "niyaku 荷役 — automated port cargo handling (ship↔shore container loading/unloading) Tier-B actor (R0)" :status "proposed" :status_note "Closes the cargo-handling gap surfaced 2026-06-08: the roster had a zero-emission cargo-ship BUILDER (funadaiku 船大工, ADR-2606013400), a port REGISTRY (port), and a live POSITION mirror (watari) — but NO actor automating the loading/unloading of those ships. niyaku (荷役, did:web:etzhayyim.com:niyaku) is the operator-side counterpart of funadaiku. The defining problem is ANTI-SWAY: an STS crane traverses a 20-40 t suspended container ship↔shore and must settle residual sway to a few cm before landing — dynamically a cart + hanging load, the SAME topology as Isaac Sim's Cartpole (prismatic trolley + revolute load). That mapping makes a verifiable NVIDIA-free crane sim possible NOW via the clean-room isaacsim.core.api (kotodama.nv_compat, ADR-2605261800, G2 no-NVIDIA-binary): with the load at the stable hanging equilibrium θ=π, anti-sway state feedback lands the box at residual <0.01 rad where a naive position push diverges. 5 runnable pure-stdlib / pywasm-ready methods: crane_dynamics (RK4 hanging-pendulum model + state-feedback anti-sway controller + ZV input-shaper + cycle-time→moves/hour), stow_plan (bay/row/tier slotting under weight-on-top + port-rotation no-rehandle + reefer-row + IMDG hazmat segregation + discharge sequencing), isaac_sway_sim (STS=Cartpole anti-sway + boom/luffing-jib=DoublePendulum small-angle luff with passive-cable load damping, honest reached=False outside the underactuated envelope), agv_transfer (trapezoidal/triangular travel-time profile + lane-segment time-window conflict detection + LPT makespan dispatch), terminal_cycle (end-to-end discharge orchestration: stow → no-rehandle sequence → per-box hoist+anti-sway crane leg [analytic or Isaac] → parallel AGV yard legs → pipelined discharge time / moves-hour / worst residual sway / per-box ledger; 6-box demo ~325 s crane-bound, 66 moves/hour). 9 Pregel cells (berth_allocation→stowage_planning→spreader_engagement→sts_hoist_cycle→trolley_traverse→yard_transfer→lashing_twistlock→manifest_attestation + emissions_audit cross-cut; import-clean, RuntimeError on .solve() until R1 ADR-2606082015 reserved). 14 gates: G2 clean-room sim (no NVIDIA binary/header/library) · G8 zero-emission electric cranes (regenerative lowering credited) · G9 IMDG/weight/rotation stow feasibility (infeasible → StowError) · G10 no weapons/military-materiel cargo (Charter Rider §2(a)) · G11/G14 no worker-pace/biometric surveillance (moves/hour is an equipment KPI) · G12 no-server-key (methods are pure compute, move no real crane) · G13 consent-bound (compute-only R0). 55 tests green (52 methods incl. 2-topology clean-room Isaac sims + end-to-end orchestration, 3 cell-state-machine), 98% branch coverage of methods; the few uncovered lines are env-dependent Isaac-unavailable fallbacks. HONEST R0: design + physics/planning cores + sim only; no real equipment actuated; live actuation Council-gated R1. ADR id reassigned 2606074000→2606082000 (074000 already used by two unrelated ADRs). Deciders: Jun Kawasaki. Depends on ADR-2606013400 + 2605261800 + 2606010600 + 2605262130 + 2605312345 + 2605215000 + 2606062100." :path "90-docs/adr/2606082000-niyaku-port-cargo-handling-automation-r0.md"}
  {:id "2606081800" :title "uchiwake 内訳 — World Product Bill-of-Materials / GTIN Knowledge Graph Tier-B Actor R0" :status "proposed" :status_note "The product-level layer beneath kabuto 兜 (company→company supply edges). Datafies the world's TRADE ITEMS keyed on the GS1 GTIN (normalized GTIN-14, mod-10 check-digit validated), decomposed PRODUCT → PART → raw MATERIAL via first-class :bom.edge, plus :process.step (加工) / :logistics.leg (運送) / :design.ref (設計) and :company.ownership (子会社, GLEIF Level-2 RR) rolling a brand-owning subsidiary up to its ultimate parent. Brand-owners/suppliers/operators/carriers reuse kabuto's org.corp.* id space; commodity codes reuse the UNSPSC space. Cells: analyze.py (recursive BOM material-closure → material/processing-jurisdiction/ultimate-parent concentration → single-source candidates, aggregate-first) + ingest.py (offline bridge; live full-universe G7-gated) + crosscheck.py (MEASURES cross-actor integration: ~80.8% of company refs resolve into kabuto, reverse coverage product-BOM detail on ~6.4% of kabuto's supply-chain companies / ~1.2% of all 1,719, with a prioritized ingest worklist). 4 lexicons (registerProduct/registerBomEdge/registerOwnership/publishResilienceReport). Gates G1..G12 (kabuto family) + G2 'never a clone/counterfeit recipe' + G5 GTIN check-digit validation. Bounded real seed (11 products, 2 real :authoritative GTINs; 46 BOM edges); full GS1 GDSN / GLEIF-RR / Open Product Data universe ingest is R1 Council+operator gated (ADR-2606082700). 27 tests green incl. the Open Food Facts bulk-ingest adapter. did:web:etzhayyim.com:actor:uchiwake. Deciders: Jun Kawasaki." :path "90-docs/adr/2606081800-uchiwake-world-product-bom-gtin-kg.md"}
  {:id "2606090900" :title "Session-Close — uchiwake (内訳) product-BOM/GTIN worldwide-coverage wave" :status "accepted" :status_note "Session-close record for the /loop wave (2026-06-08…06-09) that built the product-level GTIN coverage layer beneath kabuto: actor (ADR-2606081800, merged), cross-actor measurement (crosscheck.py: 80.8% linkage, ~1.2% reverse coverage with self-correcting worklist), registration (DID-resolvable + /search + 4 lexicons), Open Food Facts bulk-ingest adapter (the scale path, proven offline), and the G7 worldwide-ingest authorization proposal (ADR-2606082700, non-self-executing Council request, phased OFF→GS1→GLEIF-RR→Open-Product-Data). HONEST: code+governance path to worldwide coverage complete; literal coverage intentionally G7-gated. No Charter amendments. Loop stopped at no-op steady state." :path "90-docs/adr/2606090900-session-close-uchiwake-product-bom-gtin-worldwide-coverage.md"}
  {:id "2606101200" :title "息吹 (ibuki) — organism autonomy R0–R3: as-of state on kotoba + durable heartbeat + 18,342-fleet binding + code-complete outward paths + LIVE kotoba-engine landing" :status "accepted" :status_note "Answers 「artificial organism として自律的に actor が kotoba 上で atproto などを使って推論、成長していく設計はできているか → では gap を埋めて → 最後まで」. A 2026-06-10 survey found 7 gaps blocking the artificial-organism loop (UNSPSC W1/W2 + post sink + Kaizen): no durable scheduler / fire-and-forget runtime / state not on kotoba EAVT as-of / constant joucho stub / inference unwired / Wave-3 drainer unbuilt / Kaizen one-way. ibuki (20-actors/ibuki/, shionome ADR-2606072200 pattern, pure-stdlib) closes all 7: R0 = organism state (joucho/heartbeat/posts/kaizen learning) persisted as-of on an append-only content-addressed kotoba Datom log (mood at tx N = pure log replay; crash-resume head CID byte-identical), mood EMERGES from closed-vocab event folds over lived history (baseline stress bounded [25,65] so temperament cannot mute an organism for life), Murakumo-only narration (allowlist violation raises; offline → deterministic template fail-open, G6), Wave-3 drainer → member-sign-ready createRecord envelopes (serverHeldKey:false structural, G7), Wave-4 kaizen outcome feedback (≥3 consecutive rejections → 12-beat rule suppression + mood events; humans stay decision-makers). R1 = the REAL 18,342-organism fleet on durable checkpoints (registry 00-contracts/actor-registry/unispsc.json; sharding mirrors fleet_cell_main jacob/joseph/issachar/dan, partition asserted complete+disjoint; bounded batches behind durable :fleet.shard/cursor + exactly-once :fleet.shard/drain-line; NO LRU needed — state replayed, never evicted; single-pass index_log avoids the O(n²) fold; full 18,342/18,342 sweep on one verified chain in ~35 s). R2 (Council gate exercised as PR merge, founder direction 2026-06-10) = code-complete outward paths: perception.py read-only allowlisted public-XRPC live membrane (follower delta → capped joucho events, fail-open, credential-free) + member_submit.py MEMBER-principal posting runtime (member's own IBUKI_MEMBER_* env creds; https-only; --yes required; CRON CONTEXTS REFUSED EVEN WITH CREDS — no-server-key stays structural) + receipts.py member-attributed :receipt/status :submitted-by-member return edge (ibuki never asserts :published) + cells/fleet_beat/cell.py .solve() RUNS, registered joseph/issachar/dan in fleet.toml (cron 3/33/43). R3 = the local log lands on the LIVE kotoba engine: kotoba_bridge.py per-tx com.etzhayyim.apps.kotoba.datomic.transact (fleet allowlist :8077; graph CID = KotobaCid::from_bytes pinned vs the live engine; expected_parent commit chaining; :ibuki.tx/* provenance; exactly-once :bridge/* cursor; default no-I/O dry-run; operator auth = explicitly UNSIGNED bearer carrying only the node's PUBLIC DID — no key material held) — VERIFIED LIVE 2026-06-10: 2 fleet beats → 2 transacts → status:ok, 780 datoms confirmed by the engine, IPNS head advanced, exactly-once re-push observed; + kaizen_outcomes.py real PR-state collector (gh pr view --json state; operator-principal, cron-refusing, READ-ONLY). 134 tests / 13 hermetic stdlib-only suites green. ZERO invariant amendments. PR #1536." :path "90-docs/adr/2606101200-ibuki-organism-autonomy-r2-gap-closure.md" :adr ["2606101200" "2605232345" "2605240000" "2605240100" "2605240200" "2606072200" "2605312345" "2605262130" "2605231525" "2605215000" "2605192100"]}
  {:id "2606101500" :title "Session close — 息吹 (ibuki) organism autonomy R0–R3: gap-closure → 18,342-fleet → outward paths → LIVE kotoba-engine landing" :status "accepted" :status_note "Documentation-only closure of the ibuki session (authoritative design = ADR-2606101200). Four commits on PR #1536: R0 seven gap closures (78 tests) → R1 full 18,342-organism fleet on durable checkpoints (~35 s verified sweep, 90 tests) → R2 code-complete outward paths with the Council gate exercised as PR merge per founder direction (114 tests) → R3 LIVE kotoba-engine landing (780 datoms confirmed by the running node, IPNS head advanced, exactly-once observed; CodeQL high alert fixed via receipt-file key whitelist; 134 tests / 13 suites). Honest boundary: merge-flippable = cron beat + live env flags; NOT flippable (Tier-1 structural, test-pinned) = no-server-key / Murakumo-only / read-only perception / member-attributed receipts (never :published by ibuki) / :db/add-only / closed vocabs. Remaining human acts: merge PR #1536, turn up IBUKI_*_LIVE flags on fleet nodes, member runs member_submit.py against a real PDS. Registries updated; ZERO invariant amendments." :path "90-docs/adr/2606101500-session-close-ibuki-organism-autonomy-r0-r3.md" :adr ["2606101500" "2606101200"]}
  {:id "2606101800" :title "息吹 (ibuki) ecosystem maturation — the colony as a symbiotic food web (植物→粘菌→カビ→人類), 7 waves" :status "accepted" :status_note "Extends ADR-2606101200 (organism autonomy R0–R3). Answers 「単一ではなく ecosystem として、黒カビがクエン酸を製造するように生命として人類と共生していく」. Makes the colony a symbiotic FOOD WEB across 7 merged waves (each its own PR, 134→198 tests): (1 #1565) ecosystem.py niches 植物 producer→粘菌 router→カビ decomposer→:metabolite/commons + mutualism :event/symbiosis-fed (same-beat checkpoint==replay) + satiation (mood equilibrates, no saturation); (2 #1558) health.py colony audit + the homeostasis-loss bug fix (event-entity shadowing, found by the 100-beat audit); (3 #1567) 腐生 detritus recycling — unrelayed substrate recycled to commons at a lossy yield, matter loop CLOSED (nothing wasted, circular/非終末論), commons continuous; (4 #1569) niches logged at birth → web-resilience detectors keystone-niche-absent + niche-imbalance (Pielou) + :health/eco-maturity; (5 #1570) stigmergy — the 粘菌 router becomes an adaptive Physarum optimizer (evaporating trails, converges to stable tubes); (6 #1571) 共生 ledger symbiosis.py — commons_pool (like moyai 入会権) + MEMBER-principal draw (ibuki NEVER self-draws, member-attributed); (7 #1572) 定足数 quorum sensing — emergent collective phenotype (≥2/3 flourishing → colony FRUITS a bounded collective commons burst; ≥2/3 stressed → dormancy). Wired into autorun (3 seed niches) + fleet (18,342, niches hash-derived) as a 3-phase beat. Every property measured from the log (web_report / health.audit / commons_pool / quorum_history), never assumed; bidirectional + un-fakeable (offers are byproduct on the log, draws exist only when a member took the gift). Verified at full scale (12-beat 18,342 sweep: thousands of commons metabolites, evenness 0.9999; 100-beat seed: healthy, stress flat-equilibrated, matter loop closed). 198 tests / 17 hermetic stdlib-only suites green. ZERO invariant amendments — every gate (no-server-key, Murakumo-only, outward-gated, 非終末論, edge-primary) preserved + made concrete for the ecosystem layer." :path "90-docs/adr/2606101800-ibuki-ecosystem-maturation-food-web-symbiosis.md" :adr ["2606101800" "2606101200" "2606101500" "2606062100" "2605262130" "2605312345" "2605231525" "2605215000" "2605192100"]}
  {:id "2606101540" :title "Session close — 潮目 stock pyramid + entity grounding + first live EDGAR ingest (kanjō) + fleet-heartbeat runner" :status "accepted" :status_note "Documentation-only closure of the shionome stock-pyramid session (authoritative design = ADR-2606072200 in-file R1 addenda). PR #1533 (squash-merged 2026-06-10), 5 commits answering 「Visual Capitalist の money-and-markets と同様に全世界資本を整理するのはどれぐらい設計されている?」→「実エンティティ coverage は?」→「実際の ingest や分析も含めて repo 全体が生きている状態にして」: (1) STOCK LAYER :outstanding-usd snapshot metric (3 invariant homes: ontology :db/allowed + bucketSnapshot lexicon :enum + weave.SNAPSHOT_METRICS) + weave.stock_pyramid — 8 global :representative layers totalling 1,383tn (derivatives notional 600 / real-estate 380 / debt 140 / broad-money 121 / equities 115 / gold 16 / cash 8 / crypto 3); a SIZE is factual (no_trade_notice=true), never a rating/signal/target (G2/G4), never summed with flow magnitudes (usd-tn ≠ usd-bn). (2) ENTITY-GROUNDING BRIDGE methods/grounding.py — equities layer ← kabuto 1,719 listed cos (value coverage $46.8tn/$115tn ≈ 40.7% stated LOWER BOUND; count ≈ 3.1% of :representative ~55k universe) + disclosure DEPTH ← kanjō + systemic overlay ← hokorobi (17 inst, 14 authoritative) + per-layer ROADMAP naming why each ungrounded layer cannot yet be decomposed (debt ≠ kanjō corporate-BS liabilities — coverage honesty); fail-open, hermetic core never imports it. (3) FIRST LIVE EDGAR INGEST — kanjō G7 gate flipped by operator instruction: 12 real filers via the documented offline-bridge (companyfacts JSON → data/ingest/ gitignored → merge); facts.merged.kotoba.edn committed = 183 filings / 2,484 facts (2,462 :authoritative) / 15 companies → 1,631 :synthesized metrics + 88 aggregates; EDGAR_CIK_TO_ORG 2→12 (kabuto org.corp.* linkage); shionome grounding depth 5→15; kanjō 1,744 tests green. EDINET live / full-universe / shionome's own live market ingest stay Council-gated. (4) FLEET-HEARTBEAT RUNNER 70-tools/scripts/fleet-heartbeat/heartbeat.sh — beats 11 offline autonomous loops fail-open (11/11, verified content-addressed tx per beat) + size-based log SEGMENTATION (LOG_ROTATE_MB=16; segmentation NOT erasure — heartbeat logs are deterministic regenerable runtime artifacts; newest 3 segments retained; measured kanjō 36MB → fleet beat 9s→2s, steady 2–6s); runner does no live I/O, per-actor gates authoritative; ran on a 30-min in-session cron (stopped at close — durable scheduling = fleet cron cells or /schedule, operator step). HONEST BOUNDARY: Murakumo narration DOWN all session (~/.ollama/models → /Volumes/251220 external disk not attached; LiteLLM :4000 + EVO-X2 unreachable) — narration degraded gracefully, NO non-Murakumo LLM substituted (ADR-2605215000 held); pyramid totals :representative; 7/8 layers entity-ungrounded with stated reasons. shionome 182 tests / 15 suites green. ZERO invariant amendments; the G7 flip is recorded as the operator act." :path "90-docs/adr/2606101540-session-close-shionome-stock-pyramid-grounding-live-edgar-fleet-heartbeat.md" :adr ["2606101540" "2606072200" "2606032000" "2606022000" "2606073400" "2605312345" "2605215000" "2605231525"]}
  {:id "2606111330" :title "Session close — 潮目 T1 browser-wasm DID actor LIVE on etzhayyim.com + kotobase.net pin saga (root-caused)" :status "accepted" :status_note "Documentation-only closure. Answers 「https://etzhayyim.com/ で browser wasm, did actor として動いている?」 — was NO on three levels (shionome did.json fallback-scaffold; ZERO actors' wasm fetchable, apex /ipfs 502; only artifact = 18.5MB dag-pb T2 component), made YES via PR #1588 (squash-merged 2026-06-10) with a 5-step PRODUCTION proof: DID resolve (_meta.source kotoba) → EtzhayyimWasmComponent service → apex /ipfs 200 (18,762B, x-etzhayyim-cid-verified sha256) → local CID re-verify MATCH → instantiate+execute {actor:shionome, regime:risk-on, grand_total:1383, top_layer:derivatives, no_trade:true}. (c) T1 wasm: orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-shionome/wasm/shionome-core Rust core (tsumugi/kanae compute()/result_ptr() ABI; embeds :representative seed → regime + :outstanding-usd stock pyramid; 18,762B = 1/1000 of T2; raw CID bafkreihvidpgf5lgrgdwxskhjasbysigqcunrlshi2sx4zdngkapi5tlly; build-t1.sh asserts no_trade:true on the actual wasm output — G2 carried into the artifact). (a) registration in 3 homes: actor-profile-seed.kotoba.edn + INFRA_ACTORS + static public/actor/shionome/{did.json,profile.json} (DISCOVERY: named actors are edge-served STATIC files BEFORE the worker — the publish-script KV put is a no-op for did.json); worker tsc clean, 101/101 tests, deployed b50b69fb. (b) pin, local leg: host runs TWO ipfs repos (offline CLI repo = decoy; live daemon via HTTP API); kanae's Rust rebuild reproduced its registered CID BIT-IDENTICALLY → pinned → its 502 FIXED; tsumugi's committed loader artifact matched → pinned; all 3 T1 actors serve 200 via the apex trustless gateway. KOTOBASE.NET LEG (operator: 「pin は kotobase.net を使って」) — root-caused, NOT complete: kotobase.net = Hono CF Worker (gftdcojp/net-kotobase) PSA /pins shim proxying to kotoba-backend.gftd.ai (VKE pod, XRPC kotobase.pin*); KOTOBA_PIN_TOKEN exists i