  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pharma_purification" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r1-council-attestation" :description "API purification — recrystallization + activated charcoal + filtration; (chlorpheniramine only) preparative-scale HPLC for ICH M7 PGI (4-chlorobenzyl chloride) removal to ≤ 1.5 µg/day per 70 kg patient. Per ADR-2605250515 §Decision 4. Lexicon: com.etzhayyim.pharma.purificationAttestation. Proposed Murakumo node: zebulun (paired with synthesis)." :adr ["2605250515" "2605250500"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.pharma.purificationAttestation"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pharma_qc" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r1-council-attestation" :description "Per-lot QC suite (HPLC purity / IR identity / NMR / Karl Fischer water / ICP-MS Q3D heavy metal / GC headspace Q3C residual solvent / LC-MS/MS M7 PGI for chlorpheniramine / endotoxin LAL / microbial limit / sterility). Auto-reject on any ICH Q3/M7 deviation (G2). Witness invariant N≥2 (QC analyst DID + QP-equivalent DID). Per ADR-2605250515 §Decision 5. Lexicon: com.etzhayyim.pharma.qcAttestation. Proposed Murakumo node: levi (audit/witness leader)." :adr ["2605250515" "2605250500"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.pharma.qcAttestation"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pharma_sterile_fill_finish" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r2-annex-1-attestation" :description "Aseptic processing + BFS fill-finish per Annex 1 (2023 改訂). 0.22 µm sterile filter + Class A air BFS + container closure integrity test (CCIT). Hitogata class-A sterile sub-config (kuni-umi inheritance). G8 enforcement: R2→R3 transition requires 3-batch consecutive media fill + CCIT passed. Per ADR-2605250530 §Decision 3-6. Lexicon: com.etzhayyim.pharma.fillFinishAttestation. Proposed Murakumo node: joseph (commissioning leader — clean room construction extension)." :adr ["2605250530" "2605250500"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.pharma.fillFinishAttestation"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pharma_container" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r2-extractable-leachable-attestation" :description "BFS LDPE 5 mL multi-dose container manufacture / qualification. Extractable / leachable studies vs. all 3 Wave 1 formulations. CCIT per lot. R2-R3 future: religious-corp 自製 BFS resin handling + mold (Kusuko 薬子 placeholder per ADR-2605250545 §Decision 2b). Per ADR-2605250530 §Decision 1. Lexicon: com.etzhayyim.pharma.fillFinishAttestation (shared). Proposed Murakumo node: simeon (kuni-umi commissioning sibling)." :adr ["2605250530" "2605250500"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.pharma.fillFinishAttestation"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pharma_packaging" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r2-label-template-baseline" :description "Secondary packaging (FSC recycled cardboard + 添付文書) + label scanner G11 enforcement (naphazoline ≥ 0.05% MUST include 連用警告) + Apache 2.0 + Charter Rider attribution + final lot release attestation chain. Witness N≥2 (operator + QP-equivalent). Per ADR-2605250545 §Decision 4 + ADR-2605250500 §Decision 3 G4/G9/G11. Lexicon: com.etzhayyim.pharma.lotAttestation. Proposed Murakumo node: dan (decommission leader — lot 終端 natural pair)." :adr ["2605250545" "2605250500"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.pharma.lotAttestation"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pharma_cold_chain" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r2-gdp-attestation" :description "2-8°C controlled distribution (DSCG-driven SOP unification with naphazoline + chlorpheniramine on same chain). kuni-umi Otete cold-chain + Quad ground (国内 ≤ 200 km). Funamori marine for 海外 adherent community (R3+, separate ADR). Sukoyaka 健やか placeholder for patient-side last-mile (R3+). Per ADR-2605250545 §Decision 5. Lexicon: com.etzhayyim.pharma.lotAttestation (shared). Proposed Murakumo node: naphtali (logistics paired with raw-material intake)." :adr ["2605250545" "2605250500"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.pharma.lotAttestation"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pharma_adverse_event" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r3-sealed-recipient-registry-attestation" :description "Patient AE intake. Submission UI = ameno PWA + non-adherent anonymous form. Patient identity XChaCha20-Poly1305 envelope per ADR-2605181100 (sealed-recipient to Council Lv6+ DIDs only). CIOMS Form III severity + WHO-UMC causality. G5 (public reporting via aggregation) + G10 (patient identity non-traceable) + Charter Rider §2(c) (no resale to advertisers / insurers / employers). Per ADR-2605250500 §Decision 3 G5/G10 + ADR-2605250545 §Decision 6. Lexicon: com.etzhayyim.pharma.adverseEventReport. Proposed Murakumo node: levi (audit/witness)." :adr ["2605250545" "2605250500" "2605181100"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.pharma.adverseEventReport"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pharma_post_market_surveillance" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r3-aggregation-algorithm-baseline" :description "Daily AE aggregation (cron 0 8 * * * JST) + open published narrative. G10 PII isolation (no patient DID in aggregates — only by lot + severity + outcome). Signal detection: any serious/life-threatening/fatal → immediate Council Lv6+ escalation; severe cluster ≥ 3 in single lot → escalation; new symptom not in label → escalation. Per ADR-2605250500 §Decision 3 G5 + ADR-2605250545 §Decision 6. Lexicon: com.etzhayyim.pharma.adverseEventReport (read) + silenPharmaReview (signal escalation). Proposed Murakumo node: levi (paired with pharma_adverse_event)." :adr ["2605250545" "2605250500"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.pharma.adverseEventReport" "com.etzhayyim.pharma.silenPharmaReview"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pharma_tablet_manufacture" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r2-tablet-press-qualification" :description "Non-sterile oral solid (tablet / capsule) manufacture per Wave 1b. Pre-blend → granulate (wet/dry) or direct compression → final blend + compression → film-coating (HPMC + TiO₂) → blistering (PVC/aluminum) or bottling. Wave 1b API → tablet products: acetaminophen 500 mg / aspirin 325-500 mg / ibuprofen 200-400 mg / diphenhydramine HCl 25-50 mg / cetirizine 2HCl 10 mg / loratadine 10 mg / famotidine 10-20 mg. Annex 1 G8 NA (non-sterile); USP <61>/<62> microbial limit + <701>/<711>/<905>/<1216> dissolution+disintegration+CU+friability. G11 per-API label warnings (acetaminophen hepatotoxicity / aspirin Reye / ibuprofen GI+renal / diphenhydramine sedation). Per ADR-2605250600 §Decision 2. Lexicon: com.etzhayyim.pharma.fillFinishAttestation (dosageForm=tablet-*). Proposed Murakumo node: joseph (non-sterile class C)." :adr ["2605250600" "2605250500"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.pharma.fillFinishAttestation" "com.etzhayyim.pharma.qcAttestation"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pharma_topical_formulation" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r2-topical-mixer-qualification" :description "Non-sterile topical (cream / gel / ointment) compounding per Wave 1b. Oil phase + aqueous phase preparation (70-75°C) → high-shear emulsification → cooling with agitation → viscosity adjustment → aluminum tube or HDPE jar fill + crimp/seal. Wave 1b API → topical products: clotrimazole 1% cream (antifungal) + diclofenac Na 1% gel (NSAID musculoskeletal). Non-sterile for intact skin (sterile only for ophthalmic/wound/mucosal → Wave 1c carve-out). G11 per-API warnings (clotrimazole 7-14 day use limit + diclofenac topical photosensitivity / not on broken skin / not 3rd trimester pregnancy / not under occlusion). Per ADR-2605250600 §Decision 2. Lexicon: com.etzhayyim.pharma.fillFinishAttestation (dosageForm=topical-*). Proposed Murakumo node: simeon (kuni-umi commissioning sibling — container + filling pair)." :adr ["2605250600" "2605250500"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.pharma.fillFinishAttestation" "com.etzhayyim.pharma.qcAttestation"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pharma_chiral_resolution" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r1-chiral-resolution-baseline" :description "Enantiomeric separation (chiral resolution) per Wave 1c. omeprazole S-enantiomer flagship API (crystalline-resolution-mandelate via L-mandelic acid salt crystallization ~70% yield, or prep-HPLC-chiral with Chiralcel OD-H chiral stationary phase). Output: enantiomeric purity ≥ 99.5% (ICH M7 Class 5 allowable ≤ 0.5% R-enantiomer). Future Wave 1c+ candidates: levocetirizine (S-isomer, topical), levofloxacin (S-isomer, ophthalmic). Per ADR-2605250615 §Decision 3. Lexicon: com.etzhayyim.pharma.purificationAttestation (scheme in [crystalline-resolution-mandelate, prep-hplc-chiral, SFC-supercritical]). Proposed Murakumo node: levi (pharma QC/analytical). **No G7 (CWC precursor) risk** — omeprazole synthesis route omits OPCW Schedule 3 reagents (contrast Wave 1b analgesics)." :adr ["2605250615" "2605250500"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.pharma.purificationAttestation" "com.etzhayyim.pharma.qcAttestation"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pharma_liquid_formulation" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r1-cough-syrup-formulation-baseline" :description "Oral liquid formulation (syrup, solution, suspension) fill-finish per Wave 1c. Cough-expectorant syrups (guaifenesin 100 mg/5 mL, benzonatate suspension 100-150 mg/5 mL) + laxative solutions (docusate sodium liquid, post-reconstitution PEG 3350). Non-sterile fill into amber glass bottles with dosing cups. QC: microbial limit USP <61>/<62> (TAMC ≤ 10³ CFU/mL), viscosity (cone-plate rheometer), pH (4-7 range), appearance (no particles, uniform color). G11 per-API warnings (benzonatate: chewing/sucking → throat anesthesia / choking risk; laxatives: electrolyte loss with prolonged use). Per ADR-2605250615 §Decision 4. Lexicon: com.etzhayyim.pharma.fillFinishAttestation (dosageForm in [oral-liquid-syrup, oral-suspension]). Proposed Murakumo node: joseph (fill-finish sibling)." :adr ["2605250615" "2605250500"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.pharma.fillFinishAttestation" "com.etzhayyim.pharma.qcAttestation"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/py/src/kotodama/projects/uhl_right_neural" :kind "langgraph-pregel-project" :version "0.3.0" :status "P1-complete-all-treatment-arms-implemented" :description "uhl-right-neural — 先天性右側感音難聴 (neural軸) 治療研究 Pregel. 16-vertex StateGraph (V01-V16). Every substrate-routed treatment-arm vertex is now a real actor: V07 otof_tx (P1, DFNB9 / CHORD-JP), V08 neurotrophin (P2, BDNF/NT-3 research-track), V09 reprogramming (P3, Ascl1+Pou4f1+Myt1l research-track), V10 conventional_device (eCI fitting), V11 abi (P1, Manchester/GSTT pediatric pathway). Cross-cutting V01-V06 + V12 plasticity + V13 outcome (Beta-Binomial) + V14 trial_design (P1) + V15 regulatory (PMDA/FDA classifier) + V16 institution_matcher. V08 and V09 are honest preclinical/research-track classifiers — register research-pipeline contact, no current human treatment recommendation. Remaining stubs: V10b optoCI sub-variant (P3, when trial opens). 15-institution registry seed (CC-BY-4.0). Decision support only — every output enforces requires_human_review=true." :adr ["2605181000" "2605181040" "2605181050" "2605181060"] :sibling_modules ["50-infra/k8s/lg-uhl-right-neural" "60-apps/open-otology-uhl-r"] :lexicons "00-contracts/lexicons/jp/etzhayyim/med/uhl/institution" :dmn ["40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/py/src/kotodama/projects/uhl_right_neural/dmn/substrate_classifier.md" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/py/src/kotodama/projects/uhl_right_neural/dmn/plasticity_gate.md" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/py/src/kotodama/projects/uhl_right_neural/dmn/otof_eligibility.md" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/py/src/kotodama/projects/uhl_right_neural/dmn/abi_candidacy.md" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/py/src/kotodama/projects/uhl_right_neural/dmn/regulatory_pathway.md" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/py/src/kotodama/projects/uhl_right_neural/dmn/neurotrophin_eligibility.md" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/py/src/kotodama/projects/uhl_right_neural/dmn/reprogramming_eligibility.md"] :prs ["#23" "#25" "#29"]}
  {:path "50-infra/k8s/lg-uhl-right-neural" :kind "k8s-manifests" :version "0.4.0" :status "stages-1-3-live-aead-on-pvc" :description "LangServer pod manifest for the uhl_right_neural Pregel. 2-container topology per ADR-2605171800: Python server + TS @etzhayyim/sdk checkpointer sidecar sharing /run/etzhayyim/ emptyDir socket volume and PVC-backed /var/etzhayyim/checkpointer-state (lg-uhl-right-neural-checkpointer-state, ReadWriteOnce, 8Gi, requires Retain reclaim policy on the underlying PV). Both containers run as uid 65532 with fsGroup=65532. Substrate stages 1 (saver), 2 (MST), 2.5 (AEAD per ADR-2605181100), and 3 (IPFS pin to simeonnomac-mini.local:5001) are live; payload is ciphertext from MST projection onward. Stage 4 (Base L2 anchor) pending EtzhayyimAnchor deploy to Base sepolia." :adr ["2605181000" "2605180900" "2605171800" "2605172000" "2605181100"] :image "ghcr.io/etzhayyim/lg-uhl-right-neural:main" :sidecar_image "ghcr.io/etzhayyim/etzhayyim-sdk-checkpointer:main" :pvc "lg-uhl-right-neural-checkpointer-state"}
  {:path "50-infra/etzhayyim-sdk-checkpointer" :kind "container-image" :version "0.1.0" :status "C2-implemented" :description "TS sidecar container image for the @etzhayyim/sdk checkpointer (Stage 2 of ADR-2605171800). Multi-stage node:22-alpine build, prod deps via pnpm corepack, --ignore-scripts, tini for SIGTERM handling, uid 65532. Image is reusable across every langserver that opts in to MstCheckpointSaver — uhl-right-neural is the first consumer." :adr ["2605171800" "2605172000" "2605172100"] :image "ghcr.io/etzhayyim/etzhayyim-sdk-checkpointer:main" :sibling_modules ["orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-sdk" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/py/src/kotodama/checkpointer" "50-infra/k8s/lg-uhl-right-neural"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/py/src/kotodama/checkpointer" :kind "python-langgraph-checkpoint-saver" :version "0.1.0" :status "C2-integrated" :description "MstCheckpointSaver — LangGraph BaseCheckpointSaver subclass that proxies every checkpoint op (put/get_tuple/list/put_writes/health) over a Unix socket (or tcp://host:port) to the @etzhayyim/sdk TS sidecar (CheckpointerSidecar). 4-byte big-endian length prefix + msgpack envelope per ADR-2605171800 §Stage 1. Zero substrate logic Python-side per ADR-2605172100 — MST/IPFS/L2 stays in TS. Sync + async API parity. 16 mock-sidecar tests + 3 real-sidecar subprocess integration tests (gated by ETZ_SIDECAR_BIN)." :adr ["2605171800" "2605172000" "2605172100"] :sibling_modules ["orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-sdk" "50-infra/etzhayyim-sdk-checkpointer"] :wire_protocol_version 1 :prs []}
  {:path "60-apps/open-otology-uhl-r" :kind "cf-worker-appview" :version "0.1.0" :status "P1-complete" :description "kotoba AppView for uhl-right-neural. Single XRPC method jp.etzhayyim.med.uhl.institution.matchQuery proxies langserver, validates substrateClass against Lexicon knownValues, enforces requiresHumanReview/ethicsCommitteeRequired/dataExportRequiresReview=true on output. Audit lexicon jp.etzhayyim.med.uhl.institution.matchAudit declared (PII-zero, ADR-2605181040). Handler logic extracted to src/handler.ts so unit tests cover input validation, snake↔camel mapping, fetch error paths, and end-to-end round-trip without pulling in the CF Worker runtime (16 vitest tests, all green). P1 additions: emits auditable at:// records via @etzhayyim/sdk/pds on each query; includes embeddable Svelte clinician UI." :adr ["2605181000" "2605181040" "2605172000"] :did "did:web:open-otology-uhl-r.etzhayyim.com" :lexicons "00-contracts/lexicons/jp/etzhayyim/med/uhl/institution"}
  {:path "orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-sdk" :kind "sdk" :version "0.0.0" :status "scaffold" :description "kotoba + on-chain-only substrate SDK (PDS + IPFS + Base L2 + USDC + ERC-4337 + Superfluid + 0xSplits + Safe escrow). Stubs only." :adr ["2605172000" "2605172100"] :exports ["./" "./pds" "./ipfs" "./l2" "./pay"]}
