  {:path "50-infra/etzhayyim-esign-did-web" :kind "cf-worker" :version "deployed" :status "deployed-no-dns" :description "Cloudflare Worker serving did:web:esign.etzhayyim.com/.well-known/did.json. Identity for the religious-corp document-signing actor (etzhayyim-esign). Route bound at the CF zone (esign.etzhayyim.com/.well-known/did.json), but the esign.etzhayyim.com AAAA record is not yet provisioned on the etzhayyim.com zone — Worker is unreachable from public DNS until that record exists (manual CF dashboard step, AAAA @=100:: proxied, same pattern as etzhayyim.com apex)." :adr ["2605231230"] :deployed_at "2026-05-23T03:30:00Z" :worker_version "cfb3b6c0-1d13-476f-8cec-0fbc20a8a023"}
  {:path "orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-esign" :kind "cf-worker" :version "0.0.1" :status "scaffold" :description "etzhayyim-esign runtime actor — Phase 0 scaffold per ADR-2605231230. 3 XRPC procedures (com.etzhayyim.esign.requestEnvelope / signEnvelope / declineEnvelope) all return 501 NotYetImplemented. No route binding yet; Phase 1 will wire requestEnvelope through @etzhayyim/sdk + ipfs-pinner for Bootstrap Council Seats 2-5 RFP minutes (deadline 2026-06-19)." :adr ["2605231230"]}
  {:path "orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-karute" :kind "actor-manifest" :version "0.1.0" :status "phase1-scaffold" :description "karute — 電子カルテ (EMR / FHIR R5) actor. DID did:web:karute.etzhayyim.com (nanoid karu7t3e). Pipelines: listPatients / getPatient / createSoapNote (encrypt + index + Matrix notify) / createMedicationRequest (agent.chat interaction check → encrypt + index) / createObservation (encrypt + LOINC index) / getChartSummary (PHI-redacted LLM summary) / exportFhirBundle / dailyEncounters cron / coverageSnapshot cron. Capabilities include encrypted.write / encrypted.read / fhir.bundle.export per ADR-2605231100." :adr ["2605231100" "2605181100" "2605172000"] :lexicons_external_xrpc "00-contracts/lexicons/com/etzhayyim/apps/karute" :lexicons_internal_records "orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-karute/lex" :sibling_modules ["60-apps/etzhayyim-project-karute"]}
  {:path "50-infra/karute-did-web" :kind "cf-worker" :version "0.1.0" :status "scaffold-pending-keygen" :description "CF Worker serving did:web:karute.etzhayyim.com — DID Document at /.well-known/did.json (cache 5m), XRPC reverse-proxy /xrpc/* → karu7t3e.etzhayyim.com (CF Tunnel to lg-karute), static-bundle reverse-proxy /* → CF Pages karute-pages.pages.dev, /healthz Worker-local liveness. Routes karute.etzhayyim.com/* in zone etzhayyim.com. PHI never decrypts at this Worker — transport-only. Per ADR-2605231900. Pre-deploy: Ed25519 keypair generated and stored in macOS Keychain (service=etzhayyim, account=DID_PRIVATE_KEY_ED25519_KARUTE) + 1Password mirror; placeholders in did.json replaced with real publicKeyJwk.x and publicKeyMultibase." :adr ["2605231900" "2605231100"]}
  {:path "50-infra/audit-did-web" :kind "cf-worker" :version "0.1.0" :status "scaffold-pending-keygen" :description "CF Worker serving did:web:audit.etzhayyim.com — the substrate-wide canonical audit subject referenced by every actor manifest's `agent.invoke targetDid: did:web:audit.etzhayyim.com` step. Routes audit.etzhayyim.com/* in zone etzhayyim.com. /.well-known/did.json (cache 5m) + /xrpc/* forwards to AUDIT_AGGREGATOR_UPSTREAM (the aggregator service that signs the com.etzhayyim.audit.event and writes into the named subject's PDS — implementation deferred). /healthz Worker-local liveness. Per ADR-2605231700 + ADR-2605231900. Closes the constitutional gap from ADR-2605231700 ('audit subsystem deferred until first consumer lands') by provisioning the routing target as part of the karute rollout." :adr ["2605231900" "2605231700"]}
  {:path "50-infra/k8s/lg-karute" :kind "k8s-manifests" :version "0.1.0" :status "scaffold-image-not-yet-built" :description "LangServer Pod manifest for karute (mitama-udf namespace). 2-container topology per ADR-2605171800: Python langgraph server (port 8080, MstCheckpointSaver) + TS @etzhayyim/sdk-checkpointer sidecar sharing /run/etzhayyim/ emptyDir Unix socket and PVC-backed /var/etzhayyim/checkpointer-state (16Gi ReadWriteOnce Retain). Both containers run as uid 65532 with fsGroup=65532. PHI sealing mandatory — ETZ_CHECKPOINTER_ENCRYPT_CELLS=did:web:karute.etzhayyim.com. Stage 3 (IPFS pin) targets simeonnomac-mini.local:5001. Stage 4 (Base L2 anchor) deferred until EtzhayyimAnchor lands. Image `ghcr.io/etzhayyim/lg-karute:main` built via 50-infra/k8s/lg-karute/build.sh from repo root. Resources: server 200m/512Mi requests, 2 CPU/2Gi limits. Per ADR-2605231900." :adr ["2605231900" "2605231100" "2605181100" "2605171800"] :image "ghcr.io/etzhayyim/lg-karute:main" :sidecar_image "ghcr.io/etzhayyim/etzhayyim-sdk-checkpointer:main" :pvc "lg-karute-checkpointer-state"}
  {:path "orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-karute/actor.edn" :kind "actor-deploy-manifest" :version "0.1.0" :status "phase1-9-stages-defined" :description "Declarative deployment manifest for karute. 9 stages (did-worker / audit-worker / image-build / k8s-pod-apply / k8s-pod-rollout / cf-tunnel-ensure / pages-build / pages-deploy / lexicon-bundle / smoke). Each stage typed, working-dir-scoped, command-vectored, and gated by require_cap scope NSIDs (deploy.cfWorker:* / deploy.docker:* / deploy.k8s:* / deploy.pages:* / deploy.cfTunnel:*). Read by `etzhayyim actor deploy --actor karute` (70-tools/etzhayyim-cli/actor.go). Per ADR-2605232000. Smoke verified `etzhayyim actor deploy --actor karute --dry-run --only pages-build` end-to-end." :adr ["2605232000" "2605231900" "2605231100"] :sibling_modules ["70-tools/etzhayyim-cli" "orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-karute" "50-infra/karute-did-web" "50-infra/k8s/lg-karute"]}
  {:path "70-tools/etzhayyim-cli/actor.go" :kind "go-source" :version "0.2.0" :status "phase2-shipped" :description "e7m actor subcommand — `e7m actor {deploy,list,show}`. Reads actor.toml (minimal hand-rolled TOML parser; no 3rd-party dep). `deploy` runs preflight (wrangler/kubectl/docker/cloudflared on PATH), gates each stage against --capability JWS scope (FULL Ed25519 verification against granter DID document; ETZ_CAPABILITY_VERIFY=offline for structural-only, ETZ_CAPABILITY_DID_DOCUMENT=<path> for local DID doc override), executes via exec.Command with working_dir + env overlay, emits DEPLOY_EVENT JSON to stderr per stage AND async POST to https://audit.etzhayyim.com/xrpc/com.etzhayyim.audit.emitAuditEvent (ETZ_AUDIT_DISABLE=1 to skip). Supports --only <stage> / --skip <stage> / --dry-run / --non-interactive / --commit-sha. Per ADR-2605232000. 11 unit tests in actor_test.go cover TOML parse + stage gating matrix." :adr ["2605232000"]}
  {:path "70-tools/etzhayyim-cli/agent_token.go" :kind "go-source" :version "0.2.0" :status "phase2-shipped" :description "e7m agent-token subcommand — mints Ed25519-signed JWS (JWT compact) for scoped per-call deploy/XRPC authority. Single --lxm scope, default TTL 60s (max 3600). Signing key from macOS Keychain (--keychain-service etzhayyim, --keychain-account DID_PRIVATE_KEY_ED25519) or --key-file (raw 32-byte private key, base64url or std). Claim shape: iss/sub/aud/lxm/cap/iat/exp/jti. Audience DID inferred from lxm prefix (com.etzhayyim.apps.<actor>.* → did:web:<actor>.etzhayyim.com; deploy.cfWorker:<name> → did:web:<name>.etzhayyim.com). Per ADR-2605232000. 4 unit tests in agent_token_test.go: TestSignJWS_RoundTrip / WrongKeyVerifyFails / TestInferAudienceFromLxm (5 cases) / TestRandomHex_Unique (100-sample collision check)." :adr ["2605232000"]}
  {:path "70-tools/etzhayyim-cli/capability.go" :kind "go-source" :version "0.1.0" :status "phase2-shipped" :description "e7m capability subcommand — full lifecycle for com.etzhayyim.consent.capability records. `issue`: canonical-JSON payload + Ed25519 sign → JWS (no PDS write; caller forwards). `verify`: Ed25519-verify against granter DID document (HTTPS GET /.well-known/did.json OR --did-document local override). Extracts pubkey from JsonWebKey2020 OKP/Ed25519 + Ed25519VerificationKey2020 publicKeyMultibase (built-in base58btc decoder, no math/big dep — keeps binary lean). Detects forged-payload / expired / revoked / wrong-key / malformed-JWS. `revoke`: produces revocation record body (--pds-xrpc forwards). `list`: GET com.etzhayyim.apps.karute.listConsent. Also exports postAuditEvent(eventBody) used by actor.go for the DEPLOY_EVENT HTTP POST emission to https://audit.etzhayyim.com (async, best-effort, non-fatal). Per ADR-2605231400 + ADR-2605232000 + ADR-2605231700." :adr ["2605231400" "2605231700" "2605232000"]}
  {:path "70-tools/etzhayyim-cli/capability_test.go" :kind "go-test" :version "0.1.0" :status "phase2-shipped" :description "Capability lifecycle test rig — 11 tests covering verify-success / expired / forged-payload / revoked / wrong-key / offline-mode-with-payload-decode / malformed-JWS (4 sub-cases: empty/one-part/two-parts/bad-base64) / pubkey-extraction (JWK present + missing-verificationMethod) / canonical-JSON-deterministic-key-order. Self-contained — no live DID resolution; injects local DID document via verifyOpts.didDocLocal. All PASS in 0.349s." :adr ["2605232000"]}
  {:path "70-tools/etzhayyim-cli/actor_test.go" :kind "go-test" :version "0.1.0" :status "phase2-shipped" :description "Actor.toml + stage gating test rig — 11 tests covering TOML parse (3-stage fixture with [stages.env] nested table), stageGate matrix (no-cap denial / no-require-cap pass / full-scope pass / missing-scope deny / multi-required all-match pass / partial-match deny), filterStagesByName / removeStages utilities, sanitizeCommand secret-token redaction, splitTopLevelCommas. All PASS." :adr ["2605232000"]}
