  {:path "10-protocol/kotoba-datomic" :kind "protocol-spec" :version "0.0.0" :status "deprecated-superseded-by-2605262130" :superseded_by "2605262130" :description "DEPRECATED 2026-05-26 — Superseded by ADR-2605262130 (Kotoba as Canonical Storage Substrate). Originally named the Holochain-isomorphic composition of substrate primitives mandated by ADR-2605172000. The composition spec was a placeholder; kotoba (40-engine/kotoba/, 17 crates Apache-2.0) is the concrete first-party engine that ships the actual primitives natively, eliminating the composition spec as a separate artifact and eliminating the projection layer entirely (kotoba-kqe arrangements EAVT/AEVT/AVET/VAET serve hot-path reads directly over content-addressed blocks). Retained as historical reference for one R-cycle (~30 days) per ADR-2605262130 Phase 0.5; SPEC.md carries a deprecation banner; will be archived after the R-cycle. No new code references this spec." :adr ["2605262130" "2605231400" "2605172000" "2605181100" "2605192100" "2605192415" "2605232300"]}
  {:path "90-docs/baien/datasets" :kind "datalad-superdataset" :version "0.0.1" :status "P1-smoke-verified" :description "etzhayyim dataset superdataset (DataLad). One subdataset per (kind, source-host) pair. Holds only pointers + metadata + .gitattributes; bytes live in the `directory` special remote `local-store` at ${ETZ_DATASET_ROOT}/annex-store/<subdataset>/ and are mirrored to IPFS by the sidecar pinner (e7m-dataset publish-ipfs). Phase-1 smoke (2026-05-24 JST) added 2 random blobs, copied to local-store, published map CID bafkreiep2df7htkfdkzamahpbr6gmqatmkfxth2fzl3nmizd2ksldf5z2q, and round-trip-verified per-entry `ipfs cat`. text2git is ON only at the superdataset root (READMEs + pointers); subdatasets MUST be created without text2git so every binary is annexed." :adr ["2605241500"] :sibling_modules ["70-tools/e7m-dataset" "00-contracts/lexicons/com/etzhayyim/substrate/datasetPin.json"]}
