  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/py/src/kotodama/mmsheaf (reserved)" :kind "pytorch-sheaf-diffusion-library" :version "0.0.0-r0-scaffold-declared" :status "scaffold-declared-no-code" :description "Cellular sheaf diffusion library for Oka graph-aware multimodal fusion, per ADR-2605250700 R0. Declared modules: stalk.py (9-modality node stalk with mask-aware zero-row missing-modality extension), restriction.py (F_{u◁e} = MLP(x_u‖x_v) reshaped to d×d), laplacian.py (block matrix assembly + D^{-1/2} Δ_F D^{-1/2} normalisation), diffusion.py (X(t+1) = X(t) − σ(δ_F(t) (I_n ⊗ W₁(t)) X(t) W₂(t)) update), variants.py (V1 modality-specific embeddings / V2 modality-aware block-structured restriction maps / V3 modality-isolated block-diagonal / V4 V2 + learnable α_ij scalar weights per modality pair). d_node = 9 constitutionally fixed at R0 (mirrors Oka §1 modality vocabulary). d_edge = 4 (server) / 2 (edge). V4 = server FP8/bf16 deployment target on Murakumo EVO-X2 ROCm; V3 = edge BitNet 1.58 ternary distill target (block-diagonal → per-modality BitLinear plausibility). R0 declares paths only; code implementation lands in R1 ADR. New runtime dep: torch_geometric ≥ 2.5 (ROCm wheel verification required at R1 PoC)." :adr ["2605250700" "2605092345" "2605092350" "2605101000" "2605231400" "2605231500" "2605241900" "2605215000" "2605192200"] :sibling_modules ["40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/mmsheaf_diffusion_aggregator" "70-tools/baien-distill" "70-tools/scripts/bench/mmsheaf-microbench" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/py/src/kotodama"]}
