  {:path "orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-makura" :kind "tier-b-per-domain-leader-actor" :version "0.1.0-r0-scaffold-only" :status "R0-scaffold-charter-and-lexicons-only-all-cells-gated" :description "makura (枕) — religious-corp first-party foam pillow manufacturing Tier-B actor. R0 scaffold per ADR-2605261115. Foam shred-fill pillows (PU foam crumb in woven cotton / recycled poly shell) + foam slab pillows (no viscoelastic memory-foam in R0–R1). Take-back recycling chain ≥10% recycled crumb mass by R3 (G13). First circular-material constitutional pattern + first §2(c) anti-surveillance applied to consumer goods (G14 + N9). Mattresses + medical-claim + smart-IoT + licensed-IP + brominated FR are constitutional non-goals. Source methodology = YouTube `rsnSpo1O9fI` (manufacturing methodology adopted; retail layer rejected). Robotics: 2 new class reservation (Watari 綿 fabric handler R1+ / Awa 泡 foam slab+crumb handler R1+) + 4 kuni-umi inherited reuse (Otete + Mimi + Hitogata R2+ + Quad R2+)." :adr ["2605261115" "2605192100" "2605192200" "2605201400" "2605191524" "2605214000" "2605215000" "2605241500"] :sibling_actors ["kuni-umi (robotics class lineage)" "wadachi / tatekata / yakushi / watatsumi / mitsuho / hagukumi (Tier-B sibling)" "tatekata (R2 yard-sharing for pilot shop)" "kuni-umi (Quad fleet for palletizing + take-back R2+)"] :sibling_modules ["40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pillow_polyol_attestation" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pillow_isocyanate_dispensing" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pillow_foam_blowing" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pillow_foam_shredding" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pillow_fabric_attestation" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pillow_shell_sewing" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pillow_filling_close" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pillow_qc" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pillow_packaging"] :lexicons "orgs/etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-makura/wire/lexicons" :source_methodology "YouTube rsnSpo1O9fI (manufacturing methodology adopted; licensed-IP / surveillance / addictive-design retail layer rejected per §2(b) + §2(c) + §1.13)" :constitutional_firsts ["G13 take-back circular-material pattern (first consumer-goods Tier-B with mandatory ≥10% recycled mass by R3)" "G14 + N9 §2(c) anti-surveillance applied to a consumer good (no embedded sensors/RFID/NFC/PFAS-gels)"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pillow_polyol_attestation" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r1-pu-foam-chemist-sme-onboarding" :description "Polyol + catalyst + surfactant + blowing-agent raw-material attestation (L1a). Bio-content disclosed (G12). No Hg/Sn-based catalysts (G6). Water blowing-agent preferred; HFC requires Council attestation. Per ADR-2605261115 §6 L1a. Lexicon: com.etzhayyim.makura.foamBatchAttestation (precursor section). Murakumo node: naphtali." :adr ["2605261115"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.makura.foamBatchAttestation"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pillow_isocyanate_dispensing" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r1-industrial-hygienist-sme-onboarding" :description "Closed-loop MDI / TDI dispensing + worker exposure log (L1b). G6 worker exposure ≤ 5 ppb MDI / ≤ 2 ppb TDI 8h TWA; MDI preferred over TDI. G10 SBT-gated personnel. Per ADR-2605261115 §6 L1b. Lexicons: com.etzhayyim.makura.foamBatchAttestation (isocyanate section) + com.etzhayyim.makura.workerExposureRecord. Murakumo node: naphtali." :adr ["2605261115"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.makura.foamBatchAttestation" "com.etzhayyim.makura.workerExposureRecord"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pillow_foam_blowing" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r1-foam-blow-line-qualification" :description "Slabstock one-shot polyurethane foam blowing (L2). Density 40-60 kg/m³, cell structure 30-80 ppi, IPFS-pinned batch photo + density (G2), VOC ≤ CertiPUR-US / OEKO-TEX Standard 100 (G7), no PBDE/TDCPP/TCEP/Sb₂O₃ FR chemistry baseline FR-free (G8). Per ADR-2605261115 §6 L2. Lexicon: com.etzhayyim.makura.foamBatchAttestation (final section). Murakumo node: zebulun." :adr ["2605261115"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.makura.foamBatchAttestation"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pillow_foam_shredding" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r1-shredder-qualification" :description "Mechanical shredding to 8-15 mm crumb + recycled blend (L3). Recycled crumb ≥10% mass blend by R3 (G13 take-back). No fragrance / oil impregnation (N7). Dust collection + worker PPE. Per ADR-2605261115 §6 L3. Murakumo node: joseph." :adr ["2605261115"] :lexicons []}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pillow_fabric_attestation" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r1-fabric-supplier-onboarding" :description "Fabric source + dye safety + Charter Rider §2(a-h) print artwork scan (L4a). Recycled poly / organic cotton preferred. G5 Charter scan on every print artwork. N8 no licensed IP / brand co-branding. G7 OEKO-TEX Class I baby standard preferred. Per ADR-2605261115 §6 L4a. Lexicon: com.etzhayyim.makura.fabricAttestation. Murakumo node: simeon." :adr ["2605261115"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.makura.fabricAttestation"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pillow_shell_sewing" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r1-watari-robot-poc" :description "Three-side serge stitch shell assembly (L4b). Watari (R1+) robot witness. Stitch density ≥4 stitches/cm; one open seam left for filling. G1 shell-pattern CAD open-source. Per ADR-2605261115 §6 L4b. Murakumo node: dan." :adr ["2605261115"] :lexicons []}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pillow_filling_close" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r1-pneumatic-fill-line-qualification" :description "Pneumatic crumb fill ±2% + final close stitch + bilingual care label + full BoM disclosure + take-back QR (L5a). G4 JP+EN bilingual minimum. G11 max foam mass 2.0 kg. G12 full BoM disclosure. G13 take-back QR pinning. G14 no embedded electronics. Per ADR-2605261115 §6 L5a. Lexicon: com.etzhayyim.makura.pillowLotAttestation. Murakumo node: dan." :adr ["2605261115"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.makura.pillowLotAttestation"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pillow_qc" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r1-qc-line-qualification" :description "Dimensional + weight + ILD (ASTM D3574 Test B equivalent) + visual defect QC (L5b). G2 IPFS-pinned QC record. G3 Otete + Mimi witness quorum canonical. Visual reject ≤0.5%. Per ADR-2605261115 §6 L5b. Lexicon: com.etzhayyim.makura.qcRecord. Murakumo node: levi." :adr ["2605261115"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.makura.qcRecord"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/pillow_packaging" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r1-vacuum-pack-line-qualification" :description "Vacuum compression ≤40% original volume + FSC recycled carton + EPAL pallet + IPFS-pinned take-back QR + chain entry (L5c). G13 take-back chain entry confirmed. R2+ Quad palletizing. Per ADR-2605261115 §6 L5c. Lexicon: com.etzhayyim.makura.packagingRecord. Murakumo node: levi." :adr ["2605261115"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.makura.packagingRecord"]}
  {:path "20-actors/hodoki" :kind "tier-b-per-domain-leader-actor" :version "0.1.0-r0-scaffold-only" :status "R0-scaffold-charter-and-lexicons-only-all-cells-gated" :description "hodoki (解き) — religious-corp first-party ELV disassembly + materials recovery Tier-B actor. R0 scaffold per ADR-2605261215. Source methodology = YouTube `whyjio70IUU` Audi-class ELV facility (methodology adopted; OEM-monopoly right-to-repair-restricting retail layer rejected). R0 scope = M1 passenger vehicles ≤2.5t curb / ≤8 seats / gasoline+diesel+HEV+PHEV+BEV. 3 constitutional firsts: (a) G8 §2(c) anti-surveillance applied to consumer vehicles (mandatory ECU + infotainment + telematics data wipe before any disassembly); (b) G12 §2(e) right-to-repair operationalized at vehicle scale (IPFS-pinned parts catalog with VIN provenance + bilingual); (c) G13 multilateral cross-actor circular invariant (hodoki ↔ kanayama ↔ makura ↔ silicon Wave 2 ↔ hikari R2+ — first mandatory four-way). 3 new robotics class reservation (Hagasu 剥がす / Nuku 抜く / Tokike 解け) + 4 inherited reuse (Yokin kanayama R2+ / Otete + Mimi + Quad kuni-umi). Murakumo 7-node fleet reuse." :adr ["2605261215" "2605192100" "2605192200" "2605201400" "2605242000" "2605252400" "2605261115" "2605191524" "2605214000" "2605215000" "2605241500" "2605181100"] :sibling_actors ["kuni-umi (robotics class lineage + Quad logistics)" "wadachi (vehicle build-side sibling)" "kanayama (downstream metals consumer + G2 pattern inheritance)" "makura (downstream seat-foam consumer + G13 invariant closure)" "tatekata (R2 yard-sharing partner)" "yakushi / watatsumi / mitsuho / hagukumi / manabi / hikari (Tier-B sibling)"] :sibling_modules ["40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/elv_intake_audit" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/elv_depollution" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/elv_battery_handling" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/elv_parts_harvest" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/elv_catalyst_recovery" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/elv_seat_textile_recovery" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/elv_body_shred" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/elv_emissions_audit" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/elv_provenance_binder"] :lexicons "00-contracts/lexicons/com/etzhayyim/hodoki" :source_methodology "YouTube whyjio70IUU 'How Audi Strips Down Thousand of Like-New Expensive Cars Inside Massive Facility' (manufacturing methodology adopted; OEM-monopoly right-to-repair-restricting retail layer rejected per §2(e))" :constitutional_firsts ["G8 §2(c) anti-surveillance operationalized for consumer vehicles (mandatory ECU/infotainment/telematics data wipe before any disassembly; cryptographic destruction + chip-shred fallback)" "G12 §2(e) right-to-repair operationalized at vehicle scale (IPFS-pinned parts catalog with VIN provenance + part DID + condition grade + bilingual)" "G13 multilateral cross-actor circular invariant (hodoki ↔ kanayama ↔ makura ↔ silicon Wave 2 ↔ hikari R2+; first mandatory four-way invariant)"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/elv_intake_audit" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r1-elv-recycler-sme-onboarding" :description "ELV intake audit (L1a). VIN title verification + prior-owner consent + Charter Rider §2(a-h) scan + initial data-wipe attestation request. G5 Charter scan; N7 title chain documented; N8 chop-shop refusal; G11 M1 ≤2.5t enforcement. Per ADR-2605261215 §6 L1a. Lexicon: com.etzhayyim.hodoki.elvIntakeRecord. Murakumo node: naphtali." :adr ["2605261215"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.hodoki.elvIntakeRecord"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/elv_depollution" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r1-fgas-technician-sme-onboarding" :description "ELV depollution (L1b). Fluid drain + MAC F-gas capture ≥95% (G6) + airbag pyrotechnic neutralization (G7) + battery disconnect + G8 cryptographic data wipe (MANDATORY before any disassembly; physical chip-shred fallback). CONSTITUTIONAL FIRST G8: §2(c) anti-surveillance applied to consumer vehicles. Per ADR-2605261215 §6 L1b. Lexicons: com.etzhayyim.hodoki.dataWipeAttestation + com.etzhayyim.hodoki.depollutionAttestation. Murakumo node: joseph." :adr ["2605261215"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.hodoki.dataWipeAttestation" "com.etzhayyim.hodoki.depollutionAttestation"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/elv_battery_handling" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r1-li-ion-soh-bench-qualification" :description "ELV battery handling (L2). Li-ion SoH classification (≥70% → hikari R2+ second-life; <70% → cell-recycle Wave 2 ADR); lead-acid → kanayama Wave 3. G7 thermal-safety SOP (no puncture / no short-circuit / thermal-runaway containment enclosure). G13 cross-actor invariant. Per ADR-2605261215 §6 L2. Lexicon: com.etzhayyim.hodoki.batteryHandlingRecord. Murakumo node: levi." :adr ["2605261215"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.hodoki.batteryHandlingRecord"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/elv_parts_harvest" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r1-parts-catalog-publication-pipeline-ready" :description "ELV parts harvest (L3a). CONSTITUTIONAL FIRST G12: RIGHT-TO-REPAIR INVARIANT — every harvested part gets IPFS-pinned catalog entry with VIN provenance + part DID + condition grade + bilingual description; no proprietary lock-in; no anti-disassembly DRM tolerated; N8 chop-shop refusal. §2(e) anti-gatekeeping operationalized at vehicle scale. Per ADR-2605261215 §6 L3a. Lexicon: com.etzhayyim.hodoki.partsHarvestCatalog. Murakumo node: simeon." :adr ["2605261215"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.hodoki.partsHarvestCatalog"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/elv_catalyst_recovery" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r1-pgm-smelter-partnership" :description "ELV catalyst recovery (L3b). Catalytic converter brick removal + PGM (Pt/Pd/Rh) smelter handoff + yield audit. G14 ≥95% PGM yield invariant; XRF handheld estimation + smelter receipt verification; no PGM leak to ASR. R2+ Yokin (kanayama Wave 2 inheritance) bench smelter. Per ADR-2605261215 §6 L3b. Lexicon: com.etzhayyim.hodoki.catalystRecoveryRecord. Murakumo node: levi." :adr ["2605261215"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.hodoki.catalystRecoveryRecord"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/elv_seat_textile_recovery" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r1-makura-handoff-channel-stand-up" :description "ELV seat foam + textile recovery (L3c). G13 cross-actor invariant closure — seat foam routed to makura (closes makura G13 take-back ≥10% recycled crumb by R3). N7 fragrance-impregnated foam rejection (makura G7 compliance). G4 bilingual sorting. Per ADR-2605261215 §6 L3c. Murakumo node: dan." :adr ["2605261215"] :lexicons []}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/elv_body_shred" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r1-shredder-line-qualification" :description "ELV hulk shred + sort (L4). G13 ≥95% material recovery + ASR <5% to landfill + cross-actor invariant. Magnetic + eddy-current + density sort: ferrous → kanayama Wave 2 (steel R3); non-ferrous Al → kanayama Wave 1; Cu wire → kanayama Wave 3; ECU PCB → silicon Wave 2 (rare-metal recovery). Per ADR-2605261215 §6 L4. Lexicon: com.etzhayyim.hodoki.shredOutputAttestation. Murakumo node: zebulun." :adr ["2605261215"] :lexicons ["com.etzhayyim.hodoki.shredOutputAttestation"]}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/elv_emissions_audit" :kind "pregel-cell-gated" :version "0.1.0-scaffold-only" :status "import-time-RuntimeError-until-r1-continuous-monitoring-instrumentation" :description "ELV cross-cutting emissions audit. F-gas leakage continuous + ASR mass + composition + PGM yield audit. G6 F-gas ≥95% recovery; G13 ASR <5% of input mass; G14 PGM yield ≥95%. Per ADR-2605261215 §6 cross-cutting. Murakumo node: levi." :adr ["2605261215"] :lexicons []}
