  {:path "20-actors/futawa" :kind "tier-b-per-domain-leader-actor" :version "0.1.0-r0-scaffold-only" :status "R0-scaffold-charter-and-lexicons-only-all-cells-gated" :description "futawa (二輪) — religious-corp first-party small-displacement motorcycle manufacturing Tier-B actor. R0 scaffold per ADR-2605261330. Source methodology = YouTube `1xxRYlHY2e8` BMW Motorrad Berlin Spandau (methodology adopted; luxury / surveillance / racing retail layer rejected). R0 scope = ≤250cc 4-stroke single OR ≤15kW electric / curb ≤200kg / commuter+utility. 4 constitutional firsts: G7 ABS-mandatory ≥125cc (safety constitutional), G8 build-time anti-surveillance (companion to hodoki G8 EOL data destroy), G12 right-to-repair forward-publishing (IPFS parts catalog + CAD + firmware source at manufacture; companion to hodoki G12 EOL catalog), G14 30-year design service life (anti-planned-obsolescence). 2 new robotics class reservation (Tsugite 継ぎ手 / Suri 摺) + 5 inherited reuse (Yokin kanayama R2+ / Otete + Mimi + Quad kuni-umi / Tokike hodoki). Murakumo 7-node fleet reuse. Upstream consumer for kanayama (recycled metals via hodoki) + silicon Wave 2 (ECU PCB) + hikari R2+ (Li-ion second-life for electric models)." :adr ["2605261330" "2605192100" "2605192200" "2605201400" "2605242000" "2605252400" "2605261115" "2605261215" "2605191524" "2605214000" "2605215000" "2605241500"] :sibling_actors ["wadachi (4-wheel autonomous mobility R&D sibling)" "hodoki (EOL companion — G8/G12/G13 cross-lifecycle invariants)" "kanayama (recycled metals supplier via hodoki)" "makura (consumer-good anti-surveillance pattern precedent)" "kuni-umi (robotics class lineage)" "tatekata (R2 yard-sharing partner)" "yakushi / watatsumi / mitsuho / hagukumi / manabi / hikari (Tier-B sibling)"] :sibling_modules ["40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/moto_frame_welding" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/moto_engine_assembly" "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/cells/moto_drivetrain_assembly" "40-en