  {:path "70-tools/e7m-sim-preflight" :kind "robotics-simulation-substrate-preflight-evidence" :version "0.0.1-r0-preflight-evidence" :status "r0-preflight-evidence-companion-to-adr-2605261600" :description "Stack-validation harness for the e7m-sim charter (ADR-2605261600). Self-contained, Murakumo-independent, runs on a developer Apple Silicon Mac. Produces concrete pass/fail evidence (PNG / USD / PLY / stdout) for each binding library in the charter: MuJoCo 3.8.1 + mujoco-mjx 3.8.1 (JAX 0.10.1 CPU) + Mitsuba 3.8.0 (scalar_rgb + llvm_ad_rgb PRB autodiff via Homebrew libLLVM-22) + OpenUSD 26.5 (usd-core). 6 verify scripts (verify_determinism / verify_mjx / verify_mitsuba / verify_mitsuba_diff / verify_usd / verify_lidar) + 1 interactive viewer (view.py via mjpython) + 2 MJCF variants (cylinder wheels for C++ MuJoCo / capsule wheels for MJX collision-pair limitation) + 7 committed artifacts under out/. **Authoritative for ADR-2605261600 §R0 'scoring evidence skeleton' deliverable** (companion file `90-docs/baien/sim-substrate-scoring-260526.md`). **Explicitly distinct from `70-tools/e7m-sim/`** which is R0 = zero-code per charter; this harness lives at a sibling path because it is NOT operational sim (no Murakumo placement, no simulationRunAttestation emission, no G5 ≥0.75 Isaac Sim ground-truth measurement, no witness quorum, no Charter Rider §2 asset scan). Findings propagated into R1 ADR drafting requirements: (1) libLLVM build-time dep, (2) MJX capsule-only collision constraint, (3) JAX CPU loses to C++ MuJoCo by 10×, (4) PRB autodiff supports BSDF not emitter-pose, (5) mj_ray proxy validates geometry pipeline only (R2 needs CARLA lidar), (6) USD references compose cleanly for fleet ≤30. Vendor-rejection chain audit: zero NVIDIA Omniverse / Isaac Sim / Isaac Lab / OptiX / RTX / Replicator / DriveSim / Omniverse Cloud / Nucleus imports. Decommission point: when ADR-2605252630 (or equivalent R1 sim ADR) lands and populates 70-tools/e7m-sim/ with operational substrate." :adr ["2605261600" "2605252615" "2605215000" "2605191524" "2605242630"] :sibling_modules ["70-tools/e7m-sim (operational substrate; R0 = empty)" "70-tools/isaac-lab-task-port (task DSL header port; future)" "90-docs/baien/sim-substrate-scoring-260526.md (scoring evidence narrative)"] :evidence_artifacts ["out/kusawake.usda (2.9 KB ASCII USD scene; 11 prims)" "out/kusawake.usdc (2.3 KB binary USD; 78% of ASCII)" "out/kusawake_fleet.usda (982 B; 4-instance reference-based composition; 33 prims)" "out/kusawake_render.png (Mitsuba 3 scalar_rgb forward render, 640×480)" "out/diff_target.png + out/diff_final.png (Mitsuba 3 PRB BSDF autodiff, loss 0.00258 → 0.00059 over 8 iter)" "out/kusawake_lidar.ply (5760-ray mj_ray sweep; 2520 hits; ASCII PLY 84 KB)"]}
