  {:path "70-tools/e7m-dataset/src/e7m_dataset/pds_diagnose.py" :adr "ADR-2605262500" :kind "operator-diagnostic-cli" :status "shipped" :description "Operator-side diagnostic CLI for PDS resolver setup (cycle 38, mirror of vision_pii_diagnose). 3 subcommands: `check` (httpx availability + ETZ_E7M_PDS_* env + HEAD reachability probe; --skip-network bypass; exit 0=ready, 1=unreachable, 2=missing dep), `parse <at-uri>` (parse_at_uri → repo+collection+rkey; warns if non-datasetPin collection; --json for CI), `resolve <at-uri>` (real resolve_datasetpin → CID + name + revision + size; --json output; --timeout configurable). Operators run `pds_diagnose check` BEFORE assemble-usd-scene with real at-uri references (not <rkey-placeholder>) to validate PDS reachability + at-uri shape correctness."}
  {:path "70-tools/e7m-dataset/tests/test_pds_diagnose.py" :adr "ADR-2605262500" :kind "test-suite" :status "shipped" :description "9 tests for pds_diagnose.py operator CLI: check --skip-network + --json / parse canonical at-uri + --json / parse malformed returns 2 / parse wrong-collection warns / resolve happy path (monkey-patched) / resolve --json / resolve PdsError returns 1. All offline."}
  {:path "70-tools/e7m-sim/scripts/assemble_diagnose.py" :adr "ADR-2605262500" :kind "operator-diagnostic-cli" :status "shipped" :description "Operator-side diagnostic CLI for assemble-usd-scene.py (cycle 39, 3rd diagnostic CLI). 3 subcommands: `check` (yaml + recommended jsonschema/pyarrow/Pillow/scipy/numpy + scene.schema.json existence + scenes/ dir count + registered scene list; exit 0=ready, 2=critical dep missing), `inspect <scene.yaml>` (build_plan → human or JSON; reports scene name, ADR, bbox, layers w/ dispatch handlers + resolved CIDs, props w/ counts, charter scan status; exit 1=invalid scene, 2=file missing), `dry-run <scene.yaml>` (build_plan + build_usda → usda_sha256 + byte count; writes NO files; exit 1=fail, 2=file missing). Operators run `inspect` to verify layer composition before staging real Parquet/GeoTIFF; `dry-run` to verify USDA emission would succeed before committing the assemble run. Completes the W2/W3 operator diagnostic CLI triad (vision_pii_diagnose + pds_diagnose + assemble_diagnose)."}
