  {:path "70-tools/e7m-dataset/src/e7m_dataset/fetchers/mapillary.py" :adr "ADR-2605262500" :kind "dataset-fetcher-tier-c-g13-g2" :status "w3-shipped" :description "Mapillary Graph API v4 street-imagery fetcher (Tier C, CC-BY-SA 4.0; G13 fleet-internal carve-out). VisionPiiFilter REQUIRED at call time — fetcher raises VisionPiiBackendUnavailable if vision_pii_filter arg is None (G2 enforcement at fetcher boundary). Per-image flow: GET /images bbox query → list image_id+thumb_url → per image download → vision_pii_filter.redact() → frame_rejected (child) routes to rejected/<id>.json; safe frame writes redacted to images/<id>.jpg + original to annex/<id>.jpg (Council-attestation-gated unlock per §5) + detection record to detections/<id>.json. Revision = sha256 of sorted image_id list. Output license=CC-BY-SA-4.0, tier=C, g13_nc_infix_required_in_artifacts=true. Max images per fetch capped at 5000 (operator default 100). Token via MAPILLARY_TOKEN or ETZ_MAPILLARY_TOKEN env."}
