 Charter Rider v2.0 applied to all 17 crates (Phase 1) / D2 `kotoba-llm` local-inference DISABLED in religious-corp (ADR-2605215000 + Charter Rider §2(i); routing facade to Murakumo gateway only) / D3 `kotoba-server` holds NO platform private key (ADR-2605231525; `// no-server-key: read-only` marker required) / D4 `kotoba-store` S3 backend NOT primary write store for on-chain records (land / SBT / Council / Public Fund / Force / Tithe stay on-chain) / D5 substrate boundary: kotoba lives behind `@etzhayyim/sdk` shim; never imported directly from `60-apps/*` (ADR-2605172000) / D6 `kotoba-crypto` + `kotoba-signal` bit-identical to ADR-2605181100 wire format (Phase 5 test vector suite gate) / D7 kotoba-datomic composition unchanged / D8 witness quorum + attestation unchanged. **Existing `50-infra/*` impls stay live ≥1 R-cycle (~30 days) as cold backup; no deletion authorized by this ADR**. Phased rollout R0..R7 each gated by Council Lv6+ ≥3 + `e7m verify` 9 invariants + ≥99.9% byte-equality 30-day shadow." :adr ["2605262130" "2605231400" "2605231500" "2605172000" "2605172100" "2605215000" "2605181100" "2605181200" "2605192200" "2605192245" "2605192300" "2605192315" "2605192145" "2605192130" "2605192415" "2605231525" "2605231902" "2605241500" "2605241900" "2605242600"] :upstream "https://github.com/etzhayyim/kotoba" :upstream_commit "128a89d0e" :subrepo_metadata_file "40-engine/kotoba/.gitrepo" :crates ["kotoba-core (CIDv1 blake3 + KAIS 8-bit frame + Prolly Tree)" "kotoba-kse (Journal / Topic / Shelf / Vault — Knowledge Store Engine)" "kotoba-kqe (Datalog engine + Arrangement EAVT/AEVT/AVET/VAET + Delta + MV)" "kotoba-dht (Source Chain / Warrant / Neighborhood / Availability Proof)" "kotoba-net (libp2p QUIC / Noise / GossipSub / Bitswap)" "kotoba-auth (CACAO chain verification + DID Document + ETH SIWE + delegation)" "kotoba-graph (Quad API + SPARQL→Datalog + Commit DAG + atproto firehose / JetStream)" "kotoba-vm (Invoke/Result ChainEntry + CALL_FOREIGN + Pregel + Distri