  {:path ".github/workflows/kami-engine-sdk.yml" :adr "ADR-2605264300" :kind "ci-workflow" :status "iter-13-landed" :description "Path-triggered GitHub Actions workflow that regression-tests the SDK build + vitest + cyber-drill prod build chain. Triggers on changes under `40-engine/kami-engine/kami-engine-sdk/**`, `60-apps/etzhayyim-project-cyber-drill/**`, `pnpm-workspace.yaml`, `pnpm-lock.yaml`, or itself. Three steps in one job (avoids inter-job artifact transfer): SDK `svelte-package -i src/lib` build + SDK vitest (≥82 passing tests gate; pre-existing langgraph optional-peer-dep file failure tolerated) + cyber-drill `pnpm install --ignore-workspace && pnpm run build` (vite SSR + SvelteKit static adapter prerender; exercises `build.rollupOptions.external` langchain config from `b638c27e0`). Local pre-flight wall-clock: SDK build 1.65s + vitest 1.20s + cyber-drill build 2.31s. Protects ADR-2605264300 + ADR-2605265200 outcomes from future regressions."}
  {:path "60-apps/etzhayyim-project-cyber-drill/svelte/src/lib/three-renderer" :adr "ADR-2605264300" :kind "vendor-renderer" :status "iter-1-vendorized" :description "Vendor-private three.js scene surface (cyber-drill carve-out per ADR-2605172400). 12 files originally lived at `@etzhayyim/kami-engine-sdk/src/lib/{spark,webvr}/`; renamed into cyber-drill on 2026-05-26 (commit `b04c54eb5` aka the `feat(nv_compat): isaaclab.utils.math` race-renamed commit per ADR-2605264300 §1 Notes). Rewired to consume the headless SDK engine via `@etzhayyim/kami-engine-sdk/webvr`. Includes barrel `index.ts` + WebXR `ambient.d.ts` (moved from SDK). Religious-corp SDK no longer ships three.js code; cyber-drill is the only vendor app currently carrying it."}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/py/src/kotodama/organism/sensors/corp/lei_sensor.py" :adr "ADR-2605263800" :kind "dataset-sensor-impl" :status "w1-impl-landed" :description "GleifLeiSensor concrete W1 implementation (first corp sensor to ship beyond Protocol). Reads GLEIF L1 NDJSON view from corp/lei/gleif/lei-l1/<rev>/*.ndjson and yields LeiObservation per row. Tier-A CC0 1.0. G7 schema discipline: malformed LEI (≠20 chars) is skipped without halting stream. G7 determinism: hot_sample(pin.revision, n) reservoir-samples reproducibly per (pin.revision, n) seed. Passive-only invariant — NEVER hits a per-LEI live API endpoint; only reads pre-fetched IPFS-pinned subdataset. Vendor commercial-terminal imports CONSTITUTIONALLY PROHIBITED per Charter Rider §2(e)+§2(c). Smoke-tested 2026-05-26 with 4 jurisdictions (USA/USA/JPN/GBR) + 1 malformed-skip. Downstream: other corp sensors (registry/disclosure/ownership/filing-event) resolve their entity_lei field against this sensor's pin."}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/py/src/kotodama/organism/sensors/gov/worldbank_open_data_sensor.py" :adr "ADR-2605263900" :kind "dataset-sensor-impl" :status "w1-impl-landed" :description "WorldBankOpenDataSensor concrete W1 implementation (first gov sensor to ship beyond Protocol; sibling to corp/lei_sensor.py GleifLeiSensor). Reads World Bank Open Data per-indicator NDJSON from gov/statistics/worldbank-open-data/<rev>/*.ndjson and yields GovStatisticsObservation per (indicator, economy, period) tuple. Tier-A CC-BY 4.0. SDMX-style dimensions coercion (list-of-2-lists OR dict → tuple of (code, value) pairs). G7 schema discipline: rows missing indicatorCode/Title/dimensions/observationPeriod are skipped without halt. G7 determinism: hot_sample(pin.revision, n) reservoir-samples reproducibly per seed. state_aligned_flag pass-through from row (§2(g) parallel to ADR-2605262800; downstream ossekai+manabi MUST display in derived publication). missing-value semantics: value=None when upstream marks missing. Passive-only invariant — no per-indicator live API hits. Vendor commercial gov-intel terminal imports (GovWin IQ / Bloomberg Government / Politico Pro / E&E News Pro / FiscalNote / CQ Roll Call Pro) CONSTITUTIONALLY PROHIBITED per Charter Rider §2(e)+§2(c). Smoke-tested 2026-05-26 with USA/CHN/JPN GDP + CN §2(g) flag + missing-value SP.POP.TOTL + dict-shape coercion + 1 orphan-skip."}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/py/src/kotodama/organism/sensors/corp/sec_edgar_sensor.py" :adr "ADR-2605263800" :kind "dataset-sensor-impl" :status "w1-impl-landed" :description "SecEdgarSensor concrete W1 implementation (corp W1-impl #2 / overall #3). Reads SEC EDGAR per-filing NDJSON from corp/disclosures/usa/<rev>/*.ndjson and yields CorpDisclosureObservation per filing. Tier-A public-domain (17 CFR 200 / 17 USC 105). Internal _FORM_CLASS_MAP table maps 16 native SEC form codes (10-K, 10-Q, 8-K, Form 4, 13F-HR, S-1, etc.) to canonical FormClass enum; rows with unknown native codes AND no explicit `formClass` field are skipped per G7 schema discipline (rather than yielding observations that fail downstream enum). Explicit `formClass` in row takes precedence over native mapping (forward-compat). `form_class_filter` constructor parameter restricts the yielded stream to selected canonical form classes. Malformed LEI (entityLei field != 20 chars) nullifies the entity_lei observation field without dropping the row. Per-jurisdiction publication-redaction policy: SEC pass-through (upstream publishes named officers + insiders + ≥10% holders + directors); piiRedacted defaults False, flips True only if defense-in-depth PII filter modified the view at fetch time. G7 determinism: hot_sample(pin.revision, n) reservoir-samples reproducibly. Passive-only invariant — NEVER hits SEC EDGAR live API. Vendor commercial-terminal imports CONSTITUTIONALLY PROHIBITED per Charter Rider §2(e)+§2(c). Smoke-tested 2026-05-26 with real Apple 10-K + MSFT 10-Q + JPM 8-K + Apple Form 4 + 13F-HR malformed-LEI + 2 G7-skip rows; form_class_filter restriction verified."}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/py/src/kotodama/organism/sensors/corp/uk_companies_house_sensor.py" :adr "ADR-2605263800" :kind "dataset-sensor-impl" :status "w1-impl-landed" :description "UkCompaniesHouseSensor concrete W1 implementation (corp W1-impl #3 / overall #4). Reads UK Companies House Free Company Data Product (FCD) per-company NDJSON from corp/registries/gbr/companies-house/<rev>/*.ndjson and yields CorpRegistryObservation per UK CRN (~5M companies). Tier-A OGL v3.0 (Crown copyright open license). G7 schema discipline: CRN structural validation via regex (8-digit OR 2-letter-prefix+6-digit; matches E&W / SC Scotland / NI Northern Ireland / OC English-Welsh LLP / SO Scottish LLP); malformed rows skipped without halt. Lowercase CRN input upper-cased before validation (defense-in-depth normalization). Malformed LEI (entityLei != 20 chars) → entity_lei=None on observation; row still yielded. regional_prefix_filter constructor parameter restricts to per-region subset (e.g., 'SC' for Scotland-only consumer). G7 determinism: hot_sample(pin.revision, n) reservoir-samples reproducibly. Per-jurisdiction publication-redaction policy: Companies House pass-through (upstream publishes named officers + PSCs); GDPR DSARs route through chigiri.data_privacy to upstream publisher. Passive-only invariant — NEVER hits Companies House REST/streaming live APIs. Vendor commercial-terminal imports CONSTITUTIONALLY PROHIBITED per Charter Rider §2(e)+§2(c). Smoke-tested 2026-05-26 with real Apple Europe / HSBC Holdings / NatWest / Diageo / 1 NI example + 1 OC LLP + lowercase-upcase + malformed-LEI + 2 G7-skip; SC + OC regional filters verified."}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/py/src/kotodama/organism/sensors/gov/uk_hansard_sensor.py" :adr "ADR-2605263900" :kind "dataset-sensor-impl" :status "w1-impl-landed" :description "UkHansardSensor concrete W1 implementation (gov W1-impl #2 / overall #5). Reads UK Hansard per-record NDJSON from gov/parliament/gbr/hansard/<rev>/*.ndjson and yields GovParliamentObservation per parliamentary record (debate / committee / bill / vote / member-statement / petition / question). Tier-A OGL v3.0 (Open Parliament Licence mirrors Open Government Licence). Internal _RECORD_KIND_MAP table maps 12 Hansard native record-type strings (Debate, Oral Question, Written Question, Written Statement, Personal Statement, Petition, Committee, Committee Stage, Division, Vote, Bill, Bill Reading) to canonical ParliamentRecordKind enum; explicit row.recordKind takes precedence over native mapping. G7 schema discipline: rows missing required fields (recordId/sessionDateUtc/payloadCid/house) OR with unknown house value OR with unmappable nativeKind+no explicit recordKind → skip without halting stream. house_filter constructor param restricts to Commons OR Lords only; record_kind_filter restricts to selected canonical kinds (e.g., (debate, vote) for division-tracking consumers). Speaker name + role pass-through per ADR-2605263900 §5 (Hansard is the public record of parliamentary speech; GDPR DSARs route through chigiri.data_privacy to upstream Parliament publisher; religious-corp NEVER performs unilateral removal). state_aligned_flag=False (UK is NOT §2(g)-flagged). G7 determinism: hot_sample(pin.revision, n) reservoir-samples reproducibly. Passive-only invariant — NEVER hits Hansard live API. Vendor commercial gov-intel terminal imports (GovWin IQ / Bloomberg Government / Politico Pro / E&E News Pro / FiscalNote / CQ Roll Call Pro) CONSTITUTIONALLY PROHIBITED per Charter Rider §2(e)+§2(c). Smoke-tested 2026-05-26 with Commons debate (Speaker Hoyle) + Lords debate (Baroness Smith) + Oral Question (PM Starmer) + Division (vote) + Bill Reading + 3 G7-skip rows (unknown-kind + missing-cid + bad-house); house_filter=\"Lords\" + record_kind_filter=(debate,vote) restrictions verified."}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/py/src/kotodama/organism/sensors/corp/jp_edinet_sensor.py" :adr "ADR-2605263800" :kind "dataset-sensor-impl" :status "w1-impl-landed" :description "JpEdinetSensor concrete W1 implementation (corp W1-impl #4 / overall #6). Reads JP 金融庁 EDINET per-filing NDJSON from corp/disclosures/jpn/<rev>/*.ndjson and yields CorpDisclosureObservation per EDINET filing (有価証券報告書 / 四半期報告書 / 半期報告書 / 臨時報告書 / 大量保有報告書 / 大量保有変更 / 有価証券届出書). Tier-A 金融庁 open-data utilization terms (~CC-BY 4.0 practically). Internal _FORM_CLASS_MAP table maps 7 EDINET 3-digit native codes (030/120/140/150/160/350/360) to canonical FormClass enum; rows with unknown codes AND no explicit formClass field skipped per G7 schema discipline. Explicit formClass in row takes precedence (forward-compat). form_class_filter restricts yielded stream. Malformed LEI (entityLei != 20 chars) nullifies entity_lei observation field without dropping row. Per-jurisdiction publication-redaction policy: EDINET pass-through (upstream publishes 役員 + 大量保有提出者 + 株主 lists); 個人情報保護法 / 金融商品取引法 pre-disclosure redaction applied by fetcher at PII filter step if applicable; GDPR-class DSARs route through chigiri.data_privacy to upstream publisher (NEVER unilateral religious-corp removal). G7 determinism: hot_sample(pin.revision, n) reservoir-samples reproducibly. Passive-only invariant — NEVER hits EDINET v2 documents live API. Vendor commercial-terminal imports CONSTITUTIONALLY PROHIBITED per Charter Rider §2(e)+§2(c). Smoke-tested 2026-05-26 with real Sony 有報 (E01777) + Toyota 四半期 (E02144) + SoftBank 臨時 (E03182) + 大量保有 350/360 + 半期 150 (legacy) + 2 G7-skip rows; form_class_filter restriction verified."}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/py/src/kotodama/organism/sensors/gov/eu_eurostat_sensor.py" :adr "ADR-2605263900" :kind "dataset-sensor-impl" :status "w1-impl-landed" :description "EuEurostatSensor concrete W1 implementation (gov W1-impl #3 / overall #7). Reads Eurostat SDMX per-observation NDJSON from gov/statistics/eurostat/<rev>/*.ndjson and yields GovStatisticsObservation per (dataflow, dimensions, period) tuple with source='eurostat'. Tier-A Eurostat free re-use per Decision 2011/833/EU. SDMX-style dimensions coercion shared contract with WorldBankOpenDataSensor: list-of-2-lists OR dict → tuple of (code, value) pairs; malformed shapes → empty tuple → G7 skip. dataflow_prefix_filter constructor param restricts to per-prefix subset (e.g., 'nama_' for national-accounts indicators only, 'demo_' for demography, 'prc_' for prices). G7 schema discipline: rows missing indicatorCode/Title/dimensions/observationPeriod are skipped without halting stream. G7 determinism: hot_sample(pin.revision, n) reservoir-samples reproducibly. state_aligned_flag default False (Eurostat itself NOT §2(g)-flagged; per-row reporter override permitted for forward-compat). missing-value semantic: value=None when upstream marks missing. Passive-only invariant — NEVER hits Eurostat SDMX live API. Vendor commercial gov-intel terminal imports (GovWin IQ / Bloomberg Government / Politico Pro / E&E News Pro / FiscalNote / CQ Roll Call Pro) CONSTITUTIONALLY PROHIBITED per Charter Rider §2(e)+§2(c). Smoke-tested 2026-05-26 with real Eurostat dataflows: nama_10_gdp DE+FR 2024 (list-of-2-lists dims) + demo_pjan EU27 2025 (dict-shape dims coercion) + prc_hicp_manr IT 2026-04 missing-value + une_rt_m ES + 2 G7-skip rows; nama_ prefix filter restriction verified."}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/py/src/kotodama/organism/sensors/gov/us_congress_gov_sensor.py" :adr "ADR-2605263900" :kind "dataset-sensor-impl" :status "w1-impl-landed" :description "UsCongressGovSensor concrete W1 implementation (gov W1-impl #4 / overall #8). Reads Congress.gov + govinfo.gov bulk per-record NDJSON from gov/parliament/usa/congress-gov/<rev>/*.ndjson and yields GovParliamentObservation per record across BILLS / BILLSTATUS / CREC / FR collections. Tier-A public-domain (17 USC 105 US federal government works). Internal _RECORD_KIND_MAP table maps 26 Congress.gov native record-type strings (House Bill / Senate Bill / Joint Resolution / House Floor Debate / Senate Floor Debate / Committee Report / Committee Hearing / Roll Call Vote / Recorded Vote / Floor Statement / Extension of Remarks / Petition / Memorial / etc.) to canonical ParliamentRecordKind enum; explicit row.recordKind takes precedence. G7 schema discipline: rows missing required fields (recordId/sessionDateUtc/payloadCid/chamber) OR with unknown chamber value (NOT in {House, Senate}) OR with unmappable nativeKind+no explicit recordKind → skip without halting stream. chamber_filter constructor param restricts to House OR Senate only; record_kind_filter restricts to selected canonical kinds (e.g., (bill, vote) for legislative-action consumers). Speaker name + role pass-through per ADR-2605263900 §5 (Congress.gov is public record of federal legislative speech; GDPR-class DSARs route through chigiri.data_privacy to upstream Library of Congress / govinfo.gov publisher; religious-corp NEVER performs unilateral removal). state_aligned_flag=False (USA is NOT §2(g)-flagged; W4 CN sources will flip this). Sibling of UkHansardSensor (both yield GovParliamentObservation with `legislature` field disambiguating). G7 determinism: hot_sample(pin.revision, n) reservoir-samples reproducibly. Passive-only invariant — NEVER hits api.congress.gov live API. Vendor commercial gov-intel terminal imports CONSTITUTIONALLY PROHIBITED per Charter Rider §2(e)+§2(c). Smoke-tested 2026-05-27 with HR1234 House Bill + Senate bill (Schumer) + House Floor Debate (Jeffries) + Roll Call vote + Committee Report + Extension of Remarks (Rep. Jane Doe) + 3 G7-skip rows (unknown-kind + missing-chamber + bad-chamber-value); chamber_filter=Senate + record_kind_filter=(bill,vote) restrictions verified."}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/py/src/kotodama/organism/sensors/gov/jp_kokkai_kaigiroku_sensor.py" :adr "ADR-2605263900" :kind "dataset-sensor-impl" :status "w1-impl-landed" :description "JpKokkaiKaigirokuSensor concrete W1 implementation (gov W1-impl #5 / overall #9). Reads JP 国会会議録 (Diet meeting records) per-record NDJSON from gov/parliament/jpn/kokkai-kaigiroku/<rev>/*.ndjson and yields GovParliamentObservation with legislature='jp-kokkai'. Tier-A 国会図書館 publishes under 著作権法 §13 公の著作物 free-use. Internal _RECORD_KIND_MAP table maps 25 Diet native record-type strings (本会議/予算委員会/委員会/連合審査会/公聴会/参考人質疑/質疑/質問/代表質問/口頭質問/書面質問/答弁/施政方針演説/所信表明/法律案/予算案/条約承認案/決議案/採決/起立採決/記名投票/投票/請願/陳情) to canonical ParliamentRecordKind enum; explicit row.recordKind takes precedence. G7 schema discipline: rows missing required fields (recordId/sessionDateUtc/payloadCid/house) OR with unknown house value (NOT in {衆議院, 参議院}) OR with unmappable nativeKind+no explicit recordKind → skip without halting stream. house_filter constructor param restricts to 衆議院 OR 参議院 only; record_kind_filter restricts to selected canonical kinds. Speaker name + role pass-through per ADR-2605263900 §5 (国会会議録 is public record of parliamentary speech; 個人情報保護法+国会会議録法 DSARs route through chigiri.data_privacy to upstream 国会図書館 publisher; religious-corp NEVER performs unilateral removal). state_aligned_flag=False (JP NOT §2(g)-flagged). Third sibling of UkHansardSensor + UsCongressGovSensor (all three yield GovParliamentObservation, legislature field disambiguating). G7 determinism: hot_sample(pin.revision, n) reservoir-samples reproducibly. Passive-only invariant — NEVER hits kokkai.ndl.go.jp live API. Vendor commercial gov-intel terminal imports CONSTITUTIONALLY PROHIBITED per Charter Rider §2(e)+§2(c). Smoke-tested 2026-05-27 with 額賀議長 衆議院 本会議 + 石破総理 参議院 予算委員会 + 法律案 + 野田議員 代表質問 + 起立採決 + 請願 + 3 G7-skip rows; 衆議院 house_filter + (bill,vote) record_kind_filter restrictions verified."}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/crates/kotoba-kotodama/py/src/kotodama/organism/sensors/gov/us_data_gov_sensor.py" :adr "ADR-2605263900" :kind "dataset-sensor-impl" :status "w1-impl-landed-parity-complete" :description "UsDataGovSensor concrete W1 implementation (gov W1-impl #6 / overall #10 — W1 SENSOR PARITY 10/10 COMPLETE). Reads US data.gov CKAN catalog per-package NDJSON from gov/open-data/usa/data-gov/<rev>/*.ndjson and yields GovOpenDataObservation with jurisdiction='USA'. Tier-A public-domain (17 USC 105 US federal government works); per-row license_tag pass-through enables sub-licensed datasets (e.g., 'cc-by' agency-specific licenses) to carry their license through observation chain. G7 schema discipline: rows missing required fields (datasetId / title / license / payloadCid) skipped without halting stream. organization_filter constructor param restricts to per-agency consumers (e.g., 'noaa-gov' / 'epa-gov' / 'fda-hhs' / 'census-gov'); license_filter restricts to selected license set. Publisher + publishedAtUtc pass-through per ADR-2605263900 §5 (data.gov publishes federal-agency identity by design; no private PII at catalog layer). GDPR-class DSARs route through chigiri.data_privacy to upstream GSA / individual federal agency. state_aligned_flag=False (USA NOT §2(g)-flagged; W4 CN data portal sensors will flip this). First GovOpenDataSensor concrete impl; sibling UkDataGovUkSensor + JpDataGoJpSensor W1-deferred (path-reserved stub only). G7 determinism: hot_sample(pin.revision, n) reservoir-samples reproducibly. Passive-only invariant — NEVER hits catalog.data.gov CKAN live API. Vendor commercial gov-intel terminal imports (GovWin IQ / Bloomberg Government / Politico Pro / E&E News Pro / FiscalNote / CQ Roll Call Pro) CONSTITUTIONALLY PROHIBITED per Charter Rider §2(e)+§2(c). Smoke-tested 2026-05-27 with real NOAA CDO + EPA AirData + FDA Drug Approvals + Census ACS + 1 CC-BY sub-licensed dataset + 2 G7-skip rows; organization_filter='epa-gov' + license_filter=('us-pd',) restrictions verified. ═══ W1 sensor parity 10/10 ACHIEVED ═══"}
