ispatch "fp32-fallback through scalar dequant + scalarMatmulF32; R1c lands wgpu/wasm dispatch through R0 kernels (WGSL_BITLINEAR_FORWARD + WASM SIMD)" :charter_rider "via @etzhayyim/ameno package NOTICE (inherited from ameno root)"}
