  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/py/kotoba_murakumo/kotoba_murakumo/function.py" :adr "ADR-2605282000" :kind "python-module" :status "r1.1-live-dispatch" :status_note "R1.1 replaces R0 MurakumoCompatNotImplemented stubs with live httpx-backed dispatch. Function.{remote, remote_async, spawn, map, starmap, stream} all wired. .spawn() returns a FunctionCall handle (call_id uuid + concurrent.futures.Future). .map() runs in a per-call ThreadPoolExecutor with order_outputs=True (Modal default) or as-completed. .stream() is an async generator over OpenAI SSE chunks (decodes 'data: {...}\\n' lines, terminates on 'data: [DONE]'). Charter Rider §2 scan runs on input prompt and output text; KOTOBA_MURAKUMO_CHARTER_ENFORCE=1 flips advisory→enforce and raises CharterViolation before the result is returned to the caller (constitutional invariant per ADR-2605192200). NDJSON invocation log written via call-time path resolve (test fixtures can monkeypatch _DEFAULT_PATH). httpx.HTTPError → FleetUnreachable conversion preserves the attempted endpoint chain (ADR-2605282000 N4)."}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/py/kotoba_murakumo/kotoba_murakumo/client/litellm.py" :adr "ADR-2605282000" :kind "python-module" :status "r1.1-live" :status_note "Real impl: chat_completions (sync via httpx.Client) + chat_completions_async (async via httpx.AsyncClient) + chat_completions_stream (async generator decoding OpenAI SSE 'data:' chunks). Wire format mirrors kotoba-llm::http_infer.rs (POST /v1/chat/completions + Authorization: Bearer when auth_bearer). Returns the assistant content string; raises ValueError on missing choices[0].message.content; raises httpx.HTTPStatusError on non-2xx (Function._dispatch_sync converts to FleetUnreachable upstream)."}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/py/kotoba_murakumo/kotoba_murakumo/client/ollama.py" :adr "ADR-2605282000" :kind "python-module" :status "r1.1-live" :status_note "Ollama-direct (own-node gemma3:4b) — Ollama exposes the OpenAI-compat endpoint at /v1/chat/completions so this module delegates to client.litellm with auth_bearer=None. R2 wires Ollama-specific knobs (num_ctx / num_gpu / keep_alive) without touching the LiteLLM signature."}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/py/kotoba_murakumo/kotoba_murakumo/charter.py" :adr "ADR-2605282000" :kind "python-module" :status "r1.1-bound" :status_note "R1.1 binds to canonical scanner at etzhayyim_organism.sensors.charter_rider.scan via try-import (graceful fallback to local 4-regex matcher when the etzhayyim_organism package is not on sys.path — keeps kotoba_murakumo importable in isolation). Severity ladder: clean → minor (§2(c) advisory patterns only) → major (any §2(a)/(b)/(d)/(f)/(h) hit OR multi-hit §2(c)) → critical (§2(a) Weapons OR §2(f) Multi-Gen Harm with >1 hit). KOTOBA_MURAKUMO_CHARTER_ENFORCE truthy env (1/true/yes; case-insensitive) flips the enforce() helper from no-op to raising CharterViolation on severity >= major. Default off at R1.1 to support gradual rollout; R2 default-on contingent on the Council Lv6+ ratify of CHARTER-RIDER §6 attribution amendment."}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/py/kotoba_murakumo/tests/" :adr "ADR-2605282000" :kind "test-suite" :status "r1.1-42-pass-2-skip" :status_note "44 collected tests: 42 pass + 2 live_fleet skip (gated on KOTOBA_MURAKUMO_LIVE_FLEET=1 env). HTTP mocking via httpx.MockTransport (no respx dep). Coverage: 2 fleet.toml load + 8 routing decisions + 6 LiteLLM client (sync request shape / bearer auth / async / SSE stream / 500 error / malformed response) + 9 Function dispatch (litellm-gateway / MacMini / EVO-X2 + bearer / async / spawn / map / stream / NDJSON / FleetUnreachable) + 9 Charter (clean / weapons / minor-only / enforce-raises / advisory-passes / truthy env values / input-aborts / output-aborts / advisory-pass-through) + 6 Modal-compat (surface present / GPU string maps / decorator+local / live dispatch via mock / unsupported surfaces fail loud / cls @enter+@method recording) + 2 CI grep gate (clean source / injected violation flagged)."}
  {:path "40-engine/kotoba/py/kotoba_murakumo/kotoba_murakumo/economy.py" :adr "ADR-2605282100" :kind "python-module" :status "r1.3b-live" :description "mKOTO economy + Modal billing-parity Python surface. Tariff (versioned + Council-signed) / TariffRow (per-backend gpu_second_mkoto / egress_mb_mkoto / gas_per_1k_mkoto) / UsageEstimate (pre-flight) / UsageActual (post-call) / BudgetExceeded (cap exceeded by estimate) / InsufficientCredit (balance < required). default_tariff() ships R1.3a launch defaults; load() reads JSON file. estimate() + actual() use char-to-token heuristic (3.8 chars/token midpoint Gemma/Llama) + per-backend seconds-per-1k-tokens calibrated against fleet.toml verified_perf (llama3.2:3b @ evo-x2 = 83 tok/s → 12 s/1k; llama3.3:70b @ evo-x2 = 1.18 tok/s → 847 s/1k). Always ceils to nearest mKOTO so caller never under-budgets. 17 unit tests pass in test_economy.py."}
