  {:path "00-contracts/lexicons/com/etzhayyim/kotoba/economy/balanceSnapshot.json" :adr "ADR-2605282100" :kind "lexicon" :status "r1.3c-schema" :description "Per-DID mKOTO balance snapshot Lexicon (ADR-2605282100 L3). Read-side projection of canonical balance/mkoto/<DID> Quad. balanceMkoto saturated to i64 (kotoba native Mkoto unit; ADR-2605240001). MUST be >= 0 for external callers per ADR-2605282100 N5; SBT-bearer-internal carve-out for negative balance up to Council-set credit_line_mkoto at R2+. lastUpdatedSeq for stale-snapshot detection; tariffVersionInForce for 'balance covers ~N calls at current rates' UI; sbtBearer flag for negative-balance carve-out gating."}
